        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Option 1:</strong></b><span> The data path can implement arithmetic operations involving two registers (RA and RB).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Option 2:</strong></b><span> The data path can implement arithmetic operations involving one register and one immediate value.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Option 3:</strong></b><span> The data path can implement arithmetic operations involving two immediate values.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Option 4:</strong></b><span> Incorrect, as the data path is not limited to only one register and one immediate value.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Thus, </span><b><strong>Options 1, 2, and 3</strong></b><span> are correct.</span></p>",
