        "explanation": "<ol><li value=\"1\"><b><strong>Variable Initialization</strong></b><span>:</span><ul><li value=\"1\"><code><span>a = 20</span></code></li><li value=\"2\"><code><span>b = 25</span></code></li><li value=\"3\"><code><span>z</span></code><span> is a pointer to an integer, which initially does not point to any variable.</span></li></ul></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong>Pointer Assignment</strong></b><span>:</span><ul><li value=\"1\"><code><span>z = &amp;a;</span></code><br><span> The pointer </span><code><span>z</span></code><span> is now pointing to the address of variable </span><code><span>a</span></code><span>.</span></li></ul></li><li value=\"3\"><b><strong>Function Call</strong></b><span>:</span><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>The function </span><code><span>foo(z, b)</span></code><span> is called. Here, </span><code><span>z</span></code><span> points to </span><code><span>a</span></code><span>, and </span><code><span>b</span></code><span> is passed as the second argument (which is 25).</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Inside the function </span><code><span>foo(int *p, int x)</span></code><span>, </span><code><span>*p = x;</span></code><span> assigns the value of </span><code><span>x</span></code><span> (which is 25) to the location pointed to by </span><code><span>p</span></code><span>.</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>Since </span><code><span>p</span></code><span> is pointing to </span><code><span>a</span></code><span>, </span><code><span>a</span></code><span> is updated to 25.</span></li></ul></li><li value=\"4\"><b><strong>Printing the Value of </strong></b><b><code><strong>a</strong></code></b><span>:</span><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>After the function call, </span><code><span>a</span></code><span> has been updated to 25.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>The </span><code><span>printf(\"%d\", a);</span></code><span> statement prints the value of </span><code><span>a</span></code><span>, which is now 25.</span></li></ul></li></ol><h3 id=\"final-output\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>Final Output:</span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The output of the program is </span><b><strong>25</strong></b><span>.</span></p>",
