        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the following two languages over the alphabet {𝑎, 𝑏, 𝑐}, where 𝑚 and 𝑛 are natural numbers.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-indent: 36px;\"><span>𝐿</span><sub><span>1 </span></sub><span>= {𝑎</span><sup><span>𝑚</span></sup><span>𝑏</span><sup><span>𝑚</span></sup><span>𝑐</span><sup><span>𝑚+𝑛 </span></sup><span>| 𝑚, 𝑛 ≥ 1}</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-indent: 36px;\"><span>𝐿</span><sub><span>2 </span></sub><span>= {𝑎</span><sup><span>𝑚</span></sup><span>𝑏</span><sup><span>𝑛</span></sup><span>𝑐</span><sup><span>𝑚+𝑛 </span></sup><span>| 𝑚, 𝑛 ≥ 1}</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which ONE of the following statements is CORRECT?</span></p>",
