        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the following C program:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>int gate (int n) {</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&nbsp;\tint d, t, newnum, turn;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&nbsp;\tnewnum = turn = 0; t=1;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&nbsp;\twhile (n&gt;=t) t *= 10;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&nbsp;\tt /=10;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&nbsp;\twhile (t&gt;0) {</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-indent: 20px;\"><span>&nbsp;\t\td = n/t;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-indent: 20px;\"><span>&nbsp;\t\tn = n%t;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-indent: 20px;\"><span>&nbsp;\t\tt /= 10;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-indent: 20px;\"><span>&nbsp;\t\tif (turn) newnum = 10*newnum + d;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-indent: 20px;\"><span>&nbsp;\t\tturn = (turn + 1) % 2;</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;\t}</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&nbsp;\treturn newnum;</span></p><p><span>}</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>int main () {</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&nbsp;printf (\"%d\", gate(14362));</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>&nbsp;return 0;</span></p><p><span>}</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The value printed by the given C program is _______ . (Answer in integer)</span></p>",
        "options": [
          "<p><span>46</span></p>"
        ],
