        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For </span><b><strong>IMAGE</strong></b><span>:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>I → J (next letter of I)</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>M → N (next letter of M)</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>A → B (next letter of A)</span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>G → H (next letter of G)</span></li><li value=\"5\"><span>E → F (next letter of E)</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Then, the letters are placed in reverse order: </span><b><strong>FHBNJ</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For </span><b><strong>FIELD</strong></b><span>:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>F → G</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>I → J</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>E → F</span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>L → M</span></li><li value=\"5\"><span>D → E</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Then, the letters are placed in reverse order:  </span><b><strong>EMFJG</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Now, for beach</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>B → C</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>E → F</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>A → B</span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>C → D</span></li><li value=\"5\"><span>H → I</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Then, placing the letters in reverse order: </span><b><strong>IDBFC</strong></b></p>",
