        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The function </span><code><span>stringcopy(a, a + 2)</span></code><span> copies the substring starting from \"Hello World!\" (at </span><code><span>a + 2</span></code><span>) into </span><code><span>a</span></code><span>, replacing the initial </span><code><span>@#</span></code><span>. Therefore, the final value of </span><code><span>a</span></code><span> is </span><code><span>\"Hello World!\"</span></code><span>, which is printed.</span></p>",
