        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The following two signed 2’s complement numbers (multiplicand M and multiplier Q) are being multiplied using Booth’s algorithm: M: 1100 1101 1110 1101 and Q: 1010 0100 1010 1010 The total number of addition and subtraction operations to be performed is ___________. (Answer in integer)</span></p>",
