        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Multiplicand M: 1100 1101 1110 1101 (16 bits) , Multiplier Q: 1010 0100 1010 1010 (16 bits)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Initialize Q</span><sub><span>−1</span></sub><span>=0 (for the Booth algorithm). Make pairs for QQ</span><sub><span>-1</span></sub></p><ol><li value=\"1\"><b><strong>10</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Subtract</strong></b><span> M</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong>01</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Add</strong></b><span> M</span></li><li value=\"3\"><b><strong>10</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Subtract</strong></b><span> M</span></li><li value=\"4\"><b><strong>01</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>ADD M</strong></b></li><li value=\"5\"><b><strong>10</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Subtract</strong></b><span> M</span></li><li value=\"6\"><b><strong>01</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Add</strong></b><span> M</span></li><li value=\"7\"><b><strong>00</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Subtract</strong></b><span> M</span></li><li value=\"8\"><b><strong>01</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Add</strong></b><span> M</span></li><li value=\"9\"><b><strong>00</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>No operation</strong></b></li><li value=\"10\"><b><strong>10</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Subtract</strong></b><span> M</span></li><li value=\"11\"><b><strong>00</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>ADD M</strong></b></li><li value=\"12\"><b><strong>00</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>NO operation</strong></b></li><li value=\"13\"><b><strong>10</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Subtract</strong></b><span> M</span></li><li value=\"14\"><b><strong>01</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>ADD M</strong></b></li><li value=\"15\"><b><strong>10</strong></b><span> → </span><b><strong>Subtract</strong></b><span> M</span></li></ol><ul><li value=\"1\"><b><strong>Subtractions</strong></b><span>: 7 times</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong>Additions</strong></b><span>: 6 times</span></li><li value=\"3\"><b><strong>No operation</strong></b><span>: 3 times</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Thus, a total of </span><b><strong>13 operations</strong></b><span> (additions and subtractions) are performed</span></p>",
