          "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Any string</span><i><em class=\"GFGEditorTheme__textItalic\">  w  </em></i><span>with n</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> (𝑤) = n</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span>(w) is in 𝐿(𝑀)</span></p>"
