        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Minimize the given DFA:</span><br><span> Separate the final and non-final states.</span></p><pre><span>S1={1},{2,3,4,5}</span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>States 2 and 5 are both 0-closure and 1-closure.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>States 3 and 4 are also 0-closure and 1-closure.Thus,</span></p><pre><span>S2={1},{2,5},{3,4}</span><br><span>S3={1},{2,5},{3,4}</span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Therefore, states 2 and 5, as well as states 3 and 4, are indistinguishable.</span></p>",
