        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Outputs of the three multiplexers can be written as Q1=A'X</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span>+AX</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> , Q2=B'X</span><sub><span>3</span></sub><span>+BX</span><sub><span>4</span></sub><span> and Y=C'Q1+CQ2</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>On substituting x1 = 1,x2 = 1,x3 = 0,x4 = 0,we get Q1=A'+A=1,  Q2= 0 and hence, Y=C'</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For Y=1, C'=1 or C=0. There are 4 possible combinations of A,B and C where C=0</span></p><table><thead><tr><th><span>A</span></th><th><span>B</span></th><th><span>C</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>0</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>1</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>0</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>1</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>0</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>1</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>0</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>1</span></td></tr></tbody></table>",
