        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Host IP</span><b><strong> 10.1.1.16</strong></b><span> is masked with </span><b><strong>24 </strong></b><span>bits netmask, packets forwarded via R1</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Host IP </span><b><strong>10.1.1.72</strong></b><span> is masked with </span><b><strong>26</strong></b><span> bits netmask, packets forwarded via R3</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Host IP </span><b><strong>10.1.1.132</strong></b><span> and </span><b><strong>10.1.1.191</strong></b><span> is masked with</span><b><strong> 25</strong></b><span> bits netmask, packets forwarded via R2</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Host IP </span><b><strong>10.1.1.205</strong></b><span> is masked with</span><b><strong> 26 </strong></b><span>bits netmask, packets forwarded via R4</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Each host receives </span><b><strong>20 packets</strong></b><span>. Total packets to </span><b><strong>R2</strong></b><span>: 20+20=40</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE 2024 || CSE || MCQ"
