        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A - (01010)</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span>=(10)</span><sub><span>10</span></sub><span> </span><br><span>B - (11010)</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span>=(-6)</span><sub><span>10</span></sub><span> </span><br><span>A+B is 4 which is 00100 - no overflow</span><br><span>A-B is 16 which is 010000 - overflow (6 bits are used)</span><br><span>B-A is -16 which is 10000 - no overflow</span><br><span>2*B is -12 which is 10100 -overflow</span></p>",
