        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>As per the data given in the question,&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Total Time to read the entire file from the disk is &nbsp;= No of sectors * (Avg Time taken by sector)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>T = 3000 * ( Seek Time + Rot. Latency + Transfer Time)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given the average Seek time = 5 ms</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>T = 3000 * ( 5ms + 10/2 ms + 1/50 ms) = 30060 ms</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In seconds, 30.06 sec.</span></p>",
