        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>As per the given information in the question,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Page Size = 4 KB, therefore no of bits required = log</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span>[2</span><sup><span>12</span></sup><span>] = 12 bits. And, as the system is of 32 bits. Therefore, the architecture of bits will be as follows:</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20240221163812/last_a-300.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"inherit\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20240221163812/last_a.png 312w, https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20240221163812/last_a-100.png 100w, https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20240221163812/last_a-200.png 200w, https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20240221163812/last_a-300.png 300w, \" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption>&nbsp;</figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>As per the given convention,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>X = minimum no of pages</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Y = maximum no of pages</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Coming to X, there will be a minimum of 3 pages and</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>and for Y, there will be 20 + 210 pages = 1 + 1024 = 1025 pages.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence, the total number of pages i.e. X + Y = 1025 + 3 = 1028.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence, the correct answer is A.</span></p>",
