        "questionType": "MSQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>AND operation on f1,f2 will give intersection of two as ∑(3,5,7,11,13)whereas OR operation on f3 and f4 will give ∑(0,1,2,4,6,11,13)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>XOR operation on the above results will discard elements that are common to both.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Y = ∑ (0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7) =  π (8,9,10,11,12,13,14,15)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence, the correct options are A, C.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Read more about </span><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/logic-gates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>logic gates</span></a><span> .</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span></p>",
