        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>As per given in the question,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>the solution is provided in the image.</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20240219152254/18_a.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"inherit\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20240219152254/18_a.png 264w, https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20240219152254/18_a-100.png 83w, https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20240219152254/18_a-200.png 166w, \" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption>GATE CSE 2024</figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The value of f(x) dx from the range 0 to 2 is 1.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence, the correct option is B.</span></p>",
