        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So to understand u1 we must first find out what the register &nbsp;r5 is storing.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>If we can check closely the line, L02 it’s fetching an element from array b and storing it in r5</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>And Line &nbsp;L04 is storing the value present in array a, so we’re definitely performing the multiplication by &nbsp;8 in L03 is a shift-left operator. And to multiply by how many bits (in binary) do we need to shift to the left. If we can find out that number, that would be the answer to B</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><span>Option B is the right answer.</span></p>",
