        "id": 12074,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The output of a 2-input multiplexer is connected back to one of its inputs as shown in the figure.</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20230806131747/MUX.png\" alt=\"img\" width=\"inherit\" height=\"inherit\" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption>IMG2</figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Match the functional equivalence of this circuit to one of the following options.</span></p>",
