        "id": 5951,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which one of the following regular expressions correctly represents the language of the finite automaton given below</span></p><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20220307143450/Question10.PNG\" width=\"391\" height=\"inherit\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20220307143450/Question10.PNG, \" loading=\"auto\">",
