        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(a&amp;b)+ '*' = (80 &amp; 120) + 42 =80+42=122=z</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(a|b) - '-' = (80 | 120) -45=120- 45=75 = K&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(a^b) + '+'= (80 ^120)+43 = 40+43=83= S</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So, option A is the correct answer.</span></p>",
