        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The program will compile successfully and output 10 when executed.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Variables:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>i=0</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>j will iterate from −3 to 3 (inclusive).</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>count=0.</span></li></ul><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Post-increment i: The current value of i is used first, then i is incremented.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>The condition checks if i (before increment) is nonzero.</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Update for each j:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>j=1: count=0+1=1, i=2.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>j=2: count=1+2=3,i=3.</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>j=3: count=3+3=6,i=4.</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>After the loop:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>count=count+i=6+4=10.</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE 2021 || CSE || MCQ"
