        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A 12-bit Hamming codeword is given:&nbsp;</span></p><table><thead></thead><tbody><tr><td><span>d8</span></td><td><span>d7</span></td><td><span>d6</span></td><td><span>d5</span></td><td><span>c8</span></td><td><span>d4</span></td><td><span>d3</span></td><td><span>d2</span></td><td><span>c4</span></td><td><span>d1</span></td><td><span>c2</span></td><td><span>c1</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>x</span></td><td><span>y</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>0</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><span>Check for </span><b><strong>C1</strong></b><span>:&nbsp;</span></p><pre><span>c1 + d7 + d5 + d4 + d2 + d1 : 0 + 1 + x + 0 + 0 + 1 </span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x=0 ( for even parity)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><span>Check for </span><b><strong>C8</strong></b><span>:&nbsp;</span></p><pre><span>c8 + d7 + d6 + d5 : y + 1 + 1 + 0 + 0</span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>y=0 ( for even parity)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So, option </span><b><strong>(A)</strong></b><span> is correct.</span><br><br></p>",
