        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Given, recurrence relation can be written as, T(n) = T(n/2) + T(2n/5) + 7n T(n) = T((5/2)n/5) + T(2n/5) + 7n. </span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Since, sum of numerator (5/2+2 = 4.5) is less than denominator (5). </span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>So time complexity would be function itself.  Hence, T(n) = Θ(7n) = Θ(n)</span></li></ul>",
