        "id": 5347,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the following expression. </span><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/cdn-uploads/20210226182622/4411.png\" width=\"inherit\" height=\"inherit\" loading=\"auto\"><span> The value of the above expression (rounded to 2 decimal places) is ___________.</span></p>",
