        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Record size in Index  = 12+7  = 19 and Block size  = 4096  Number of Index records in 1 Block  = floor(4096/19)  = 215 records in 1 block. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Number of Blocks in the Index File  = Total Number of records/Records per block  = ceil(1,50,000/215) = </span><b><strong>698</strong></b></p>",
