        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In the diagram we have total 8 edges and each of the edge have 2 options either to choose 0 or 1 for each of the&nbsp;5&nbsp;positions </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So we got 8 x 2</span><sup><span>5</span></sup><span> = 2</span><sup><span>8</span></sup><span> = 256.</span></p>",
