        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For n&gt;2, let a∈{0, 1}</span><sup><span>n</span></sup><span> be a non-zero vector. Suppose that x is chosen uniformly at random from {0,1}</span><sup><span>n</span></sup><span>. Then, the probability that Σ(from i=1 to i=n)(a</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span>.x</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span>) is an odd number is _________ .</span><br><br><br><b><strong>Note -</strong></b><span> This question was Numerical Type.</span></p>",
