        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Area of 1 blue circle, </span></p><pre><span>= π((b-a)/2)</span><sup><span>2</span></sup></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> Hence, area of n blue circles, </span></p><pre><span>= nπ((b-a)/2)</span><sup><span>2</span></sup></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>   Now, Area of annular ring  </span></p><pre><span>= πb</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> – πa</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> </span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>  Now, answer is, Unpainted area: </span></p><pre><span>= (Area of annular ring) – (Area of n blue color circles)</span><br><span>= ( πb</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> – πa</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> ) - ( nπ((b-a)/2)</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> )</span><br><span>= π( b</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> – a</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> ) - π( (n/4)(b-a)</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> )</span><br><span>= π[(b</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span>−a</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span>)−(n/4)(b−a)</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span>] </span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>  Option (A) is correct. </span></p>",
