        "id": 9259,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What is the minimum number of 2-input NOR gates required to implement 4-variable function expressed in sum-of-minterms from as f = Σ(0, 2, 5, 7, 8, 10, 13, 15)? Assume that all the inputs and their complements are available. Answer  ________ .</span><br><br><br><br><b><strong>Note:</strong></b><span> This was Numerical Type question.</span></p>",
