        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In where condition no condition over Roll_no so query produces all groups.  </span></p><table><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>Student_name</span></th><th style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>Sum (P.marks)</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span>Amit</span></td><td><span>452</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>Priya</span></td><td><span>452</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>Rohan</span></td><td><span>452</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>Smita</span></td><td><span>452</span></td></tr><tr><td><span>Vinit</span></td><td><span>452</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>  Total </span></p><p><b><strong>5</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> different student names all 5 group records in result. See: </span></p><a href=\"http://sqlfiddle.com/#!9/8a79d3/1/0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>http://sqlfiddle.com/#!9/8a79d3/1/0</span></a>",
