        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Let share of each student = x  Since cost of gift will be same in both situation, therefore, </span></p><pre><span>→ 10*x = 8*(x + 150) </span><br><span>→ 10*x = 8*x + 8*150</span><br><span>→ 2*x = 8*150</span><br><span>→ x = 8*150 / 2</span><br><span>→ x = 600 </span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>  Therefore, cost of gift is, </span></p><pre><span>10*x = 10*600 = 6000 </span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>  Option (C) is correct.   </span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE 2019 || CSE || MCQ"
