        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>State Table : </span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131521350856/State-Table.webp\" alt=\"State-Table\" width=\"600\" height=\"501\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131521350856/State-Table.webp 600w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131521350856/State-Table-100.webp 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131521350856/State-Table-200.webp 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131521350856/State-Table-300.webp 300w\" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>State Diagram:</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131548454697/State-Diagram.webp\" alt=\"State-Diagram\" width=\"450\" height=\"401\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131548454697/State-Diagram.webp 450w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131548454697/State-Diagram-100.webp 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131548454697/State-Diagram-200.webp 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20241226131548454697/State-Diagram-300.webp 300w\" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Transition back to the same state means self loop, they are asking number of self loop states. </span><b><strong>Number of self loop states are 2 </strong></b><span>( which are 00 and 11). </span><b><strong>Option (A) is CORRECT.</strong></b><span>&nbsp;</span></p>",
