        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the following grammar  </span></p><pre><span>p --&gt; xQRS</span><br><span>Q --&gt; yz|z</span><br><span>R --&gt; w|∈</span><br><span>S -&gt; y</span><br></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> Which is FOLLOW(Q)? </span></p>",
