        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>An air pressure contour line join the locations in the region having the same atmospheric pressure. The following is the air pressure contour of a geographical region. The contour line are shown as 0.05 bar intervals in this plot.</span><br><br><br><img src=\"http://www.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/gq/2017/02/aptitute_1.png\" alt=\"aptitute_1\" width=\"224\" height=\"141\" loading=\"auto\"><br><span>If the probability of thunderstorm is given by how fast air pressure rises or drops over a region. Which of the following region is most likely to have thunderstorm.</span></p>",
