        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>P - iii Syntax tree is input to semantic analyser</span><br><br><span>Q - iv&nbsp;Character stream is input to lexical analyser.</span><br><br><span>R - i Intermediate code is input to code generator</span><br><br><span>S -ii &nbsp;Token stream is input to syntax analyser.</span><br><br><b><strong>Therefore option C</strong></b><br><br><br><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xcubPntmL3Y?start=722\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></iframe></p>",
