        "correctAnswer": 0,
        "correctAnswers": [
          0
        ],
        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given, </span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Q -&gt; R(Primary Key)</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>S -&gt; P (Primary Key)</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> Entry to be deleted - P (3) and Q(8) </span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Q can be deleted directly</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Now, S - &gt; P but the relationship given is on delete set NULL, Therefore when &nbsp;we delete 3 from &nbsp;T1 ,the &nbsp;entry in T2 having 3 will be NULL.</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> Therfore, Option A &nbsp;- Answer is&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>0 entries</strong></b></p>",
