        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Let L1 and L2 be any context-free language and R be any regular language. Then, which of the following is correct ? </span></p><pre><span>I. L1 ∪ L2 is context-free.</span><br><span>II. L1' is context-free.</span><br><span>III. L1-R is context-free.</span><br><span>IV. L1 ∩ L2 context-free.</span><br></pre>",
