        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/various-properties-of-context-free-languages-cfl/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Context free language</span></a><span> is closed under union and difference with regular language.</span><br><br><span>It is not closed under complementation and intersection. Complement of CFL is recursive language.</span><br><br><br><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2_61UCrVLc8?start=1542\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></iframe></p>",
