        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Size of memory = 2</span><sup><span>40</span></sup><br><span>Page size = 16KB = 2</span><sup><span>14</span></sup><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span>No of pages= size of Memory/ page size = 2</span><sup><span>40</span></sup><span> / 2</span><sup><span>14</span></sup><span> = 2</span><sup><span>26</span></sup><br><span>Size of page table = 2</span><sup><span>26</span></sup><span> * 48/8 bytes = 2</span><sup><span>6</span></sup><span>*6 MB =384 MB</span><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><span>Thus, A is the correct choice.</span></p>",
