        "id": 5971,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the following context-free grammars:&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"http://www.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/gq/2016/02/gt8.png\" alt=\"gt8\" width=\"inherit\" height=\"inherit\" loading=\"auto\"><span>Which one of the following pairs of languages is generated by G1 and G2, respectively&nbsp;</span></p>",
