        "explanation": "<pre><span>Throughput of 1st case T1: 1/max delay =1/800</span><br><span>Throughput of 2nd case T2: 1/max delay= 1/600</span><br><span>%age increase in throughput: (T2-T1)/T1</span><br><span>            = ( (1/600) - (1/800) ) / (1/800)</span><br><span>            = 33.33%</span></pre><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PmA5Ic9vc9o?start=450\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></iframe>",
