        "id": 6447,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A processor can support a maximum memory of 4 GB, where the memory is word-addressable (a  word  consists  of  two  bytes).   The  size  of  the  address  bus  of  the  processor  is  at ____  least bits. &nbsp; Note : This question was asked as Numerical Answer Type.</span></p>",
