        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The surface area of the body will remain unchanged as when a cube is removed, it exposes three faces, which makes the number of exposed faces same as before removal. &nbsp; So, surface area of the body before removal = surface area of the body after removal = 6 * side * side = 6 * 4 * 4 = 96. &nbsp; Thus, D is the correct choice.</span></p>",
