        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For 'n' variables, we need atleast 'n' linear equations in terms of the given&nbsp; variable to find value of each variable. If no. of equations &gt; no. of variables then also we can find the value of each variable. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Here, m : No. of linear equations</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>n : No. of variables For solution, m &gt; or = n. </span></p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hmtz4zIohNQ?start=1612\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></iframe>",
