        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Grammar A has direct left recursion because of the production rule: A-&gt;Aa. Grammar C has indirect left recursion because of the production rules:S-&gt; Aa and A-&gt;Sc Grammar D has indirect left recursion because of production rules : A-&gt; Bd and B-&gt; Ae Grammar B doesn't have any left recursion (neither direct nor indirect).   </span></p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9LF8Bby1Qhc?start=342\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></iframe>",
