        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the DFAs M and N given above. The number of states in a minimal DFA that accepts the language L(M) ∩ L(N) is __________. </span></p><p><br></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/cdn-uploads/gq/2015/07/question2015.png\" width=\"inherit\" height=\"inherit\" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p><br></p>",
