        "explanation": "<pre><span>g(h(x)) = g(x/(x-1)) = 1 - x/(x-1) = -1/(x-1)</span><br><br><span>h(g(x)) = h(1-x) = (1-x)/((1-x) - 1) = -(1-x)/x</span><br><br><br><span>g(h(x)) / h(g(x))  = [-1/(x-1)] / [-(1-x)/x]</span><br><span>                   = -x/(x-1)</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><br><br><span>Therefore: -x/(x-1)</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> is same as </span><b><strong>h(x) / g(x). Hence option (A) is correct.</strong></b><span> </span></pre>",
