        "explanation": "<pre><span>fun(5) = 1 + fun(1) * fun(4) + fun(2) * fun(3) + </span><br><span>             fun(3) * fun(2) + fun(4) * fun(1)</span><br><span>       = 1 + 2*[fun(1)*fun(4) + fun(2)*fun(3)]</span><br><br><span>Substituting fun(1) = 1</span><br><span>       = 1 + 2*[fun(4) + fun(2)*fun(3)]</span><br><br><span>Calculating fun(2), fun(3) and fun(4)</span><br><span>fun(2) = 1 + fun(1)*fun(1) = 1 + 1*1 = 2</span><br><span>fun(3) = 1 + 2*fun(1)*fun(2) = 1 + 2*1*2 = 5</span><br><span>fun(4) = 1 + 2*fun(1)*fun(3) + fun(2)*fun(2)</span><br><span>       = 1 + 2*1*5 + 2*2 = 15</span><br><br><span>Substituting values of fun(2), fun(3) and fun(4)</span><br><span>fun(5) = 1 + 2*[15 + 2*5] = 51 </span><br></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence Option(C) is the correct answer.</span></p>",
