          "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>E = a</span><sub><span>b</span></sub><span> exp(b</span><sub><span>b</span></sub><span>), D = c</span><sub><span>b</span></sub><span>(KLOC) exp(d</span><sub><span>b</span></sub><span>)</span></p>",
