        "correctAnswer": 0,
        "correctAnswers": [
          0
        ],
        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<h3 id=\"analysis-of-each-sentence\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><strong>Analysis of Each Sentence</strong></b></h3><ol><li value=\"1\"><b><strong>\"Since the report lacked needed information, it was of no use to them\"</strong></b><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>This sentence is grammatically correct and conveys the meaning effectively.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong>Correct usage of \"lacked\" and \"of no use.\"</strong></b></li></ul></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong>\"The report was useless to them because there were no needed information in it\"</strong></b><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>The phrase \"no needed information\" is incorrect because \"information\" is uncountable, so it should be \"no necessary information.\"</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong>Grammatically incorrect.</strong></b></li></ul></li><li value=\"3\"><b><strong>\"Since the report did not contain the needed information, it was not real useful to them\"</strong></b><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>The phrase \"not real useful\" is incorrect; it should be \"not really useful.\"</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong>Grammatically incorrect.</strong></b></li></ul></li><li value=\"4\"><b><strong>\"Since the report lacked needed information, it would not had been useful to them\"</strong></b><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>The phrase \"would not had been\" is incorrect; it should be \"would not have been.\"</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong>Grammatically incorrect.</strong></b></li></ul></li></ol><h3 id=\"correct-sentence-sincethereportlackedneededinformationitwasofnousetothem\" style=\"text-align:left\"><b><strong>Correct Sentence</strong></b><span>: \"Since&nbsp;the&nbsp;report&nbsp;lacked&nbsp;needed&nbsp;information,&nbsp;it&nbsp;was&nbsp;of&nbsp;no&nbsp;use&nbsp;to&nbsp;them.\"</span></h3>",
