        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<pre><span>The question asks value of fg (h(2, 5, 7, 3), 4, 6, 8)</span><br><br><span>We need to first find value of h(2, 5, 7, 3) </span><br><br><span>h is defined as </span><br><span>h(p, q, r, s) = remainder of (p × q) / (r × s)  if (p × q) &gt; (r × s)</span><br><span>                remainder of (r × s) / (r × q)  if (r × s) &gt; (p × q)</span><br><br><span>h(2, 5, 7, 3) = remainder of (7 * 3) / (2 * 5)  since 7*3 &gt; 2*5</span><br><span>              = 1</span><br><br><span>fg(1, 4, 6, 8) = f(1, 4, 6, 8) * g(1, 4, 6, 8)</span><br><span>               = max(1, 4, 6, 8) * min(1, 4, 6, 8)</span><br><span>               = 8 * 1</span><br><span>               = 8</span></pre>",
