        "explanation": "<pre><span>Block Size = 16 bytes</span><br><span>Block Offset = 4 </span><br><br><span>No. of sets or cache lines = 2</span><sup><span>12</span></sup><br><span>Number of index bits = 12</span><br><br><span>Size of main memory = 2</span><sup><span>20</span></sup><br><span>Number of tag bits = 20 - 12 - 4 = 4 </span><br><br><span>Let us consider the hex address E201F</span><br><span>Tag lines = First 4 bits = E (in hex)</span><br><span>Cache lines = Next 12 bits  = 201 (In Hex) </span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lz3J33WzNOo?start=2229\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></iframe></p>",
