        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<pre><span>S1 | X | Y |   |   | X | Y | X | Y |   |   | X | Y |</span><br><span>S2 |   | X | Y | X | Y |   |   | X | Y | X | Y |   |</span><br><span>S3 |   |   | X | Y |   |   |   |   | X | Y |   |   |</span><br></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> We can interleave instructions like the above pattern.  Latency between X and Y is 1.  Latency between fist and second X is 5.  The pattern repeats after that. So, MAL is (1 + 5)/2;  </span></p>",
