        "id": 6690,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the following statements. </span></p><pre><span>I. TCP connections are full duplex.</span><br><span>II. TCP has no option for selective acknowledgment</span><br><span>III. TCP connections are message streams.</span></pre>",
