        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>If Ist is followed, then hold and wait will never happen.  II, III and IV are similar. If any of these is followed, cyclic wait will not be possible.</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE 2015 || CSE || MCQ"
