        "explanation": "<pre><span>Length = 2 km</span><br><span>Propagation Speed v = 2*10^8 m/s</span><br><span>Token Holding Time = 2 micro sec</span><br><br><span>Waiting time</span><br><span>= length/speed + (#stations - 1)*(token holding time) to </span><br><span>  length/speed + (#stations)*(token holding time)</span><br><span>= 28 to 30</span><br><br></pre>",
