        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<pre><span>Transmission delay = Frame Size/bandwidth</span><br><span>                   = (1*8*1024)/(1.5 * 10^6)=5.33ms</span><br><span>Propagation delay = 50ms</span><br><span>Efficiency = Window Size/(1+2a) = .6</span><br><br><span>a = Propagation delay/Transmission delay</span><br><span>So, window size = 11.856(approx)</span><br><span>min sequence number = 2*window size = 23.712</span><br><span>bits required in Min sequence number = log</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span>(23.712)</span><br><span>Answer is 4.56</span><br><br><span>Ceil(4.56) = 5 </span><br></pre>",
        "tag": "GATE 2014 || CSE || MCQ"
