        "correctAnswers": [
          0
        ],
        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<pre><span>It was a numerical digit type question so answer must be 4.</span><br><br><span>As for 6 stages, non-pipelining takes 6 cycles.</span><br><br><span>There were 2 stall cycles for pipelining for 25% of the instructions</span><br><br><span>So pipe line time = (1+(25/100)*2) = 1.5</span><br><br><span>Speed up = Non pipeline time/Pipeline time = 6/1.5 = 4</span></pre><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BVk8ZlNukmg?start=345\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></iframe>",
