          "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The consumer will remove no more than one item from the buffer.</span></p>",
          "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Deadlock occurs if the consumer succeeds in acquiring semaphore s when the buffer is empty.</span></p>",
          "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The starting value for the semaphore n must be 1 and not 0 for deadlock-free operation. </span></p>"
