        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Let  be the encoding of a Turing machine as a string over&nbsp;∑= {0, 1}.&nbsp; Let L = {  |M is a Turing machine that accepts a string of length 2014 }. Then, L is</span></p>",
