        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<pre><span>An Intruder can’t learn [I1] through sniffing at R2 because </span><br><span>URLs and Download are functioned at Application layer of OSI Model.</span><br><br><span>An Intruder can learn [I2] through sniffing at R2 because</span><br><span>Port Numbers are encapsulated in the payload field of IP Datagram.</span><br><br><span>An Intruder can learn [I3] through sniffing at R2 because IP </span><br><span>Addresses and Routers are functioned at network layer of OSI Model.</span><br><br><span>An Intruder can’t learn [I4] through sniffing at R2 because </span><br><span>it is related to Data Link Layer of OSI Model.</span><br></pre>",
