        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<pre><span>From 2 to 198 there are 19 multiples of 10.</span><br><br><span>These are 10,20,30.....180,190.</span><br><br><span>This is an A.P series, whose sum is (n/2{a1 + aN}), </span><br><span>where a1 and aN are the 1st and last terms respectively.</span><br><br><span>Putting in the formula,</span><br><br><span>a1 = 10, aN = 190.</span><br><br><span>Sum = Sn = (19/2{10 + 190 }) = 1900</span><br><br><span>Average = Sum / Total number = 1900 / 19 = 100. </span></pre>",
