        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the decision problem 2CNFSAT defined as follows:</span><br><br><img src=\"http://www.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/gq/2014/04/GATECS2014Q551.png\" alt=\"GATECS2014Q55\" width=\"550\" height=\"100\" loading=\"auto\"><br></p>",
