        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>If any employee has received rating other than 'GOOD' from any of their customers, then there will be some rows returned by the inner query; And NOT EXISTS will return false so those employees won't be printed.   Only those employees which have got rating 'GOOD' from all of their customers will be printed.</span></p>",
