          "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Students who are not participating should come by 10.00 a.m. and they should not bring their parents. Participating students should come at 9.00 a.m.</span></p>",
          "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Participating students should come before 9.00 a.m. Parents who accompany them should come at 9.00 a.m. All others should come at 10.00 a.m.</span></p>"
