        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>If 6 resources are there then it may be possible that all three process have 2 resources and waiting for 1 more resource.  Therefore, all of them will have to wait indefinitely.  If 7 resources are there, then atleast one must have 3 resources so deadlock can never occur.</span></p>",
