        "id": 7421,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the basic block given below. </span></p><pre><span>  a = b + c</span><br><span>  c = a + d</span><br><span>  d = b + c</span><br><span>  e = d - b</span><br><span>  a = e + b </span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span> The minimum number of nodes and edges present in the DAG representation of the above basic block respectively are </span></p>",
