        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Simplifying the given equations :</span><br><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><br><span>d = b + c  (given)      e =  d – b (given)</span><br><span>  =&gt;  d = b + c    and    e = c</span><br><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><br><span>e = d -  b  (given)      a = e + b (given)      </span><br><span>  =&gt;  a = d</span><br><br><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><br><img src=\"http://www.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/gq/2015/12/2014-set3-441-291x300.jpg\" alt=\"2014-set3-44\" width=\"291\" height=\"300\" loading=\"auto\"><br><br><br><span>&nbsp;</span><br><br><span>Thus, the given DAG has 6 nodes and 6 edges.</span><br><br><br></p>",
