        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>There are total 90 two digit numbers, out of them 13 are divisible by 7, these are 14, 21, 28, 35, 42, 49, 56, 63, 70, 77, 84, 91, 98. Therefore, probability that selected number is not divisible by 7 = 1 - 13/90 = 77/90. So, option (D) is true.     </span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE 2013 || CSE || MCQ"
