        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In the following truth table, V = 1 if and only if the input is valid.</span><br><img src=\"http://www.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/gq/2013/10/gatecs20133.png\" alt=\"gatecs20133\" width=\"336\" height=\"204\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What function does the truth table represent?</span></p>",
