        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which of the following statements is/are TRUE for undirected graphs?&nbsp;</span></p><pre><span>P: Number of odd degree vertices is even.</span><br><span>Q: Sum of degrees of all vertices is even. </span></pre>",
