        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Here we are finding Distinct names of students who scored &gt;90 in course 107in each options so answer is (A) ,i.e.,I, II, III and IV</span><br></p>",
        "tag": "GATE 2013 || CSE || MCQ"
