        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For a 4 bit multiplier, there are 2</span><sup><span>4</span></sup><span> * 2</span><sup><span>4</span></sup><span> combinations, i.e., 2</span><sup><span>8</span></sup><span> combinations.</span><br><span>Also, Output of a 4 bit multiplier is 8 bits.</span><br><span>Thus, the amount of ROM needed = 2</span><sup><span>8</span></sup><span> * 8 = 2</span><sup><span>11</span></sup><span> = 2048 bits = 2Kbits</span></p>",
