        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The IEEE 754 standard specifies following distribution of bits:</span><br><span>Sign bit: 1 bit</span><br><span>Exponent width: 8 bits</span><br><span>Significand or Fraction: 24 (23 explicitly stored)</span><br><br><span>0.5 in base 10 means 1 X 2</span><sup><span>-1</span></sup><span> in base 2.</span><br><br><span>So exponent bits have value -1 and all fraction bits are 0.</span><br><br></p>",
