        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A table </span><code><span>T(X, Y)</span></code><span> initially has one record </span><code><span>(1, 1)</span></code><span>. New records are inserted 128 times with:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>X = MX + 1,   Y = 2*MY + 1</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>where </span><code><span>MX</span></code><span> and </span><code><span>MY</span></code><span> are the current maximums of X and Y.What will </span><code><span>MAX(X)</span></code><span> and </span><code><span>MAX(Y)</span></code><span> be after all insertions?</span></p><pre><span>SELECT Y FROM T WHERE X=7;</span></pre>",
