        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A block to access in L2 cache requires 20 nanoseconds, and 2 seconds to place in L1-cache.</span><br><br><span>The block&nbsp;size in L1 cache is 4 words, so total time is = time to access L2 + time to place in L1 = 20+2 = 22 ns.</span><br><br><br><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/D94hqMo-FWs?start=309\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></iframe></p>",
