        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>5 skilled workers can build a wall in 20 days 1 skilled worker can build the same wall in 100 days  Capacity of each skilled worker is 1/100   8 semi-skilled workers can build a wall in 25 days  1 semi-skilled worker can build the same wall in 200 days  Capacity of each semi-skilled worker is 1/200   Capacity of 1 unskilled worker is 1/300   Capacity of 2 skilled + 6 semi-skilled + 5 unskilled workers is 2(1/100) + 6(1/200) + 5/300  = 1/15.</span></p>",
