        "id": 4862,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which of the following statements are true? </span></p><pre><span>I. Shortest remaining time first scheduling may cause starvation</span><br><span>II. Preemptive scheduling may cause starvation</span><br><span>III. Round robin is better than FCFS in terms of response time</span></pre>",
