        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p>[Tex]\r\n\\mathbb{E}[\\mathbb{E}[X \\mid Y]] = \\sum_y \\left( \\sum_x x \\, \\Pr(X = x \\mid Y = y) \\right) \\Pr(Y = y)\r\n\r\n[/Tex]</p><p><span> </span>[Tex]\r\n\\sum_{x}\\sum_{y} x \\Pr(X = x, Y = y)\r\n\r\n[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\r\n\\sum_{x} x\\,\\Pr(X = x) = \\mathbb{E}[X]\r\n\r\n[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>so ,  </span><b><strong>E[E[X|Y]] = E[X]</strong></b><span>.</span></p>",
