        "explanation": "<ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Inner query finds max loan in SR Nagar = 65000.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Outer query returns loans with amount &gt; 65000.</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>Loans L11 (90000), L23 (80000), L25 (70000) → </span><b><strong>3 rows</strong></b><span>.</span></li></ul>",
