        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For the first hidden layer (h1), let the neurons be h11,h12,h13</span></p><pre><span>h11=1⋅x1+1⋅x2=x1+x2</span><br><span>h12=1⋅x1+1⋅x3=x1+x3</span><br><span>h13=1⋅x1+1⋅x2+1⋅x3=x1+x2+x3</span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For the second hidden layer (h2), let the neurons be h21,h22</span></p><pre><span>h21=h22=2⋅h11+2⋅h12+2⋅h13</span><br><span>              =2(3x1+2x2+2x3)</span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For the output layer, the final output is:</span></p><pre><span>y=3⋅h21+3⋅h22=3(h21+h22)</span><br><span>  =12(3x1+2x2+2x3) </span><br><span>  = 36x1 + 24x2 + 24x3</span></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Comparing with resultant artificial neural network, p=36, q=24 and r=24</span></p>",
