        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>First In First Out (FIFO)</strong></b><span> → </span><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/queue-data-structure/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b><strong>Queues</strong></b></a><span> (Elements are processed in the order they arrive).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Lookup Operation</strong></b><span> → </span><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/hash-table-data-structure/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b><strong>Hash Tables</strong></b></a><span> (Efficient key-value pair retrieval).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Last In First Out (LIFO)</strong></b><span> → </span><a href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/stack-data-structure/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b><strong>Stacks</strong></b></a><span> (Last inserted element is processed first).</span></p>",
