        "id": 78318,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Select all choices that are subspaces of ℝ </span><sup><span>3</span></sup><span> . </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Note</strong></b><span>: ℝ denotes the set of real numbers.</span></p>",
