        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Let 𝑋 be a random variable uniformly distributed in the interval [1, 3] and 𝑌 be a  random variable uniformly distributed in the interval [2, 4]. If X and Y are  independent of each other, the probability P(𝑋 ≥ 𝑌) is ______ (rounded off to  three decimal places)</span></p>",
