        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For an exponential random variable X with parameter λ&gt;0:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The expectation E(X)=1/λ</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The variance Var(X)=1/λ</span><sup><span>2</span></sup></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given 5E(X)=Var(X)</span></p><pre><span>5⋅1/λ=1/λ</span><sup><span>2</span></sup></pre><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Solve for λ, λ=0.2</span></p>",
