        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The sum of the following infinite series is 2 + 1/2 + 1 /3 + 1 /4 + 1 /8 + 1/ 9 + 1 /16 + 1/27 + ⋯ </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>[GATE 2024 || DA || 1 Marks || MCQ]</strong></b></p>",
