        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using </span><b><strong>single-linkage clustering</strong></b><span> (nearest neighbor):</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Start with the smallest distance d = 1: x1 and x2 form a cluster.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Merge x4 and x5 since d=1 between them.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Evaluate x3:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Distance to {x1,x2}: min⁡(4,3)=3</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Distance to {x4,x5}: min⁡(2,5)=2</span><br><span>x3 merges with {x4,x5}</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Final clusters: {x1,x2} and {x3,x4,x5}</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence, answer is A</span></p>",
