        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Drawing the truth table for this we get:</span></p><p><br></p><table><thead><tr><th><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>X</span></p></th><th><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Y</span></p></th><th><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Z</span></p></th><th><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>F</span></p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><p><span>0</span></p></th><td><p><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>0</span></p></td></tr><tr><th><p><span>0</span></p></th><td><p><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>0</span></p></td></tr><tr><th><p><span>0</span></p></th><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>0</span></p></td></tr><tr><th><p><span>0</span></p></th><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span></p></td></tr><tr><th><p><span>1</span></p></th><td><p><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>0</span></p></td></tr><tr><th><p><span>1</span></p></th><td><p><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span></p></td></tr><tr><th><p><span>1</span></p></th><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>0</span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span></p></td></tr><tr><th><p><span>1</span></p></th><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span></p></td><td><p><span>1</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Now pick those values where we see 1 in the output and draw 3 variable K-Map.</span></p><p>[Tex]\\begin{array}{c|cccc}\r\n  &amp; \\bar{y}\\bar{z} &amp; \\bar{y}z &amp; yz &amp; y\\bar{z} \\\\\r\n\\hline\r\n\\bar{x} &amp;  &amp;  &amp; 1 &amp;  \\\\\r\nx       &amp; 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 &amp;  \\\\\r\n\\end{array}\r\n[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence option A by grouping we get  </span><i><em class=\"GFGEditorTheme__textItalic\">F= </em></i><span>𝑋𝑌+𝑌𝑍+𝑍𝑋</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
