        "explanation": "<p>[Tex]f(x) \\geq 0 \\text{ given in } [2,\\, 8] = [a,\\, b] \\, \\, \\, \r\n\\text{by F.T.I.C} \\\\[1em]\r\n\r\nm(b - a) \\leq \\int_a^b f(x)\\, dx \\leq M(b - a) \\\\[1em]\r\n\r\nm(8 - 2) \\leq \\int_2^8 f(x)\\, dx \\leq M(8 - 2) \\\\[1em]\r\n\r\n6m \\leq \\int_2^8 f(x)\\, dx \\leq 6M \\\\[1em]\r\n\r\n\\therefore f(x) \\geq 0 \\\\\r\n\\Rightarrow \\quad m \\text{ and } M \\geq 0 \\\\[1em]\r\n\r\n\\therefore \\text{The possible answer is} \\\\\r\n\r\n5m \\leq \\int_2^8 f(x)\\, dx \\leq 7M\r\n[/Tex]</p>",
