        "correctAnswer": 0,
        "correctAnswers": [
          0
        ],
        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given, </span>[Tex]C = 0 \\Rightarrow \\overline{C} = 1[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>From the circuit:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Top part gives </span>[Tex]X = \\overline{(A + B)} + C[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Bottom part gives AB</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>These combine to F = AB + X</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Final output: </span>[Tex]Y = \\overline{F} \\cdot \\overline{C}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Substitute C = 0:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>X = (A + B)̄</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>F = AB + (A + B)̄</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using De Morgan:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\overline{(A + B)} = \\overline{A}\\,\\overline{B}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]F = AB + \\overline{A}\\,\\overline{B}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Y = F̄ = (AB + ĀB̄)̄</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]Y = \\overline{A}B + A\\overline{B}[/Tex]</p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
