        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Distributive property:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> (A + B)(A + C) = AA + AC + AB + BC</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= A + AC + AB + BC</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]= A(1 + C + B) + BC[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= A + BC</span></p>",
