        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>f = (X + Y)(X + Y̅) + (XY̅ + X̅)̅</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using Boolean identities:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(X + Y)(X + Y̅) = X</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>and</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(XY̅ + X̅)̅ = (X̅ + Y)X = XY</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>f = X + XY</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using absorption law:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>X + XY = X</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>f = X</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
