        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tLet ABCD be four variables.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Total number of variables </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= A, A̅, B, B̅, C, C̅, D, D̅</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>i.e. 8</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tNumber of total elements in the 4 variable K Map = 2</span><sup><span>4</span></sup><span> = 16\tNumber of distinct Boolean expressions </span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t\t= 2</span><sup><span>16</span></sup><span> = 65536</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span><b><strong>Shortcut:</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tThe number Boolean expressions is nothing but of possible functions = 2^(2^n)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\tn = 4 = 2^(2^4)= 2</span><sup><span>16</span></sup><span> = 65536</span></p>",
