        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Identify MUX Inputs from the Circuit:</strong></b></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>I₀: Output of OR gate with inputs P and Q̄ → P + Q̄</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>I₁: Connected directly to P → P</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>I₂: Output of AND gate with inputs P and Q → PQ</span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>I₃: Connected directly to P → P</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Identify Select Lines:</strong></b></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>S₁ = R (Most Significant Bit)</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>S₀ = S (Least Significant Bit)</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Derive Output Expression (Z):</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Equation for 4×1 MUX:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Z = R̅S̅I₀ + R̅SI₁ + RS̅I₂ + RSI₃</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Substituting the input values:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Z = R̄S̄(P + Q̄) + R̄S(P) + RS̄(PQ) + RS(P)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Simplification:</strong></b></p><ul><li value=\"1\">[Tex]Z = P\\overline{R}\\,\\overline{S} + \\overline{Q}\\,\\overline{R}\\,\\overline{S} + P\\overline{R}S + PQR\\overline{S} + PRS[/Tex]</li><li value=\"2\">[Tex]Z = P(\\overline{R}\\,\\overline{S} + \\overline{R}S + RS + RSQ) + \\overline{Q}\\,\\overline{R}\\,\\overline{S}[/Tex]</li><li value=\"3\">[Tex](\\overline{R} + S + RQ) = (\\overline{R} + S + Q)[/Tex]</li><li value=\"4\">[Tex]Z = P\\overline{R} + PS + PQ + \\overline{Q}\\,\\overline{R}\\,\\overline{S}[/Tex]</li><li value=\"5\">[Tex]Z = PQ + P\\overline{Q}S + \\overline{Q}\\,\\overline{R}\\,\\overline{S}[/Tex]</li></ul>",
