        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Let inputs be P₁, P₂</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Display conditions:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>00 -&gt; 0</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>10 -&gt; 2</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>01 -&gt; 5</span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>11 -&gt; E</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>From the 7-segment patterns of 0, 2, 5, E write Boolean expressions for each segment. On simplifying, only two complemented inputs (P̄₁, P̄₂) are required -&gt; 2 NOT gates.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The segment expressions can be implemented using sum of products, which require a total of 3 OR gates. </span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
