        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Output Y = 1 when A &gt; B, where both A and B are 2-bit numbers.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>List cases:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>If B = 00: A = 01, 10, 11 -&gt; 3 cases</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>If B = 01: A = 10, 11 -&gt; 2 cases</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>If B = 10: A = 11 -&gt; 1 case</span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>If B = 11: no valid A &gt; B</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Total combinations: </span></p><p><span>3 + 2 + 1 = 6</span></p>",
