        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For a full adder, carry output is:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>C</span><sub><span>out</span></sub><span> = AB + B C</span><sub><span>in</span></sub><span> + A C</span><sub><span>in</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using a 4:1 MUX with select lines S</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = A, S</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> = B</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>When AB = 00:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>C</span><sub><span>out</span></sub><span> = 0 → I</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> = 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>When AB = 01:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>C</span><sub><span>out</span></sub><span> = C</span><sub><span>in</span></sub><span> → I</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = C</span><sub><span>in</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>When AB = 10:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>C</span><sub><span>out </span></sub><span>= C</span><sub><span>in</span></sub><span> → I</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> = C</span><sub><span>in</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>When AB = 11:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>C</span><sub><span>out </span></sub><span>= 1 → I</span><sub><span>3</span></sub><span> = 1</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>I</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> = 0, I</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = C</span><sub><span>in</span></sub><span>, I</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> = C</span><sub><span>in</span></sub><span>, I</span><sub><span>3</span></sub><span> = 1</span></p>",
