        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For a 2 x 1 MUX:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Output = S̄ I</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> + S I</span><sub><span>1</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>First MUX:</strong></b></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Select = X</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>I</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> = Y, I</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = 0</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Second MUX:</strong></b></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Select = Z</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>I</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> = F</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = X̄Y</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>I</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = F̄</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = (X̄Y)̄ = X + Ȳ</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>F = Z̅(X̅Y) + Z(X + Y̅)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Simplify:</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>F = X̅Y Z̅ + XZ + Y̅Z</span></p>",
