        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>A 4-bit ripple counter and a 4-bit synchronous counter are made using flip-flops having a propagation delay of 10 ns each. If the worst-case delay in the ripple counter and the synchronous counter be R and S, respectively, then</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2003 || EC || MCQ || 2 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
