        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Propagation delay in a 4-bit ripple counter = 4Td = 40 ns, because the delay accumulates through all 4 flip-flops.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Since all the flip-flops in a synchronous counter are clocked simultaneously, the worst-case propagation delay is equal to the delay of only one flip-flop = 10 ns.</span></p>",
