        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tFor this logic circuit, in the case of n flip-flops, the time period of the last output waveform=2</span><sup><span>n</span></sup><span>T.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tWhere T = Time period for clock pulse</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tΔT = propagation delay of one flip-flop</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tn· ΔT = Delay time.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tThe time period of waveform of output at Q</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = 2 × </span><br><span>2T = 4T</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tTime delay at the output, Q</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = 2·ΔT.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>",
