        "id": 171913,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Two D flip-flops are connected to form a synchronous counter. The counter follows the sequence of states:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Q_B Q_A : 00 → 11 → 01 → 10 → 00 → ...</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Find the correct expressions for the inputs D</span><sub><span>A</span></sub><span> and D</span><sub><span>B</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2011 ||  EC || MCQ || 1 MARK)</strong></b><br/></p>",
