        "id": 171954,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tA three-bit pseudo-random number generator is shown. Initially, the value of output Y = Y</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span>Y</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span>Y</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> is set to 111. The value of output Y after three clock cycles is   </span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-22-164222\" height=\"115\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250922164138858015/Screenshot-2025-09-22-164222.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250922164138858015/Screenshot-2025-09-22-164222.png 326w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250922164138858015/Screenshot-2025-09-22-164222-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250922164138858015/Screenshot-2025-09-22-164222-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250922164138858015/Screenshot-2025-09-22-164222-300.png 300w\" width=\"326\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/><span>( </span><b><strong>GATE 2015</strong></b><span> ||  EC || MCQ || 1 MARK)</span></p>",
