        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>It’s an 8-bit DAC, so total levels = </span>[Tex]2^8 = 256[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Full-scale range = 0 to 7.68 V</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So, 1 step (LSB):</span></p><p>[Tex]\\frac{7.68}{256} = 0.03\\ \\text{V}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Convert binary to decimal</strong></b></p><p><span>10010110 = 128+16+4+2=150</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Output voltage</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>V=150×0.03=4.5 V</span></p>",
