        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>DAC output:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>V</span><sub><span>DAC</span></sub><span> = 2</span><sup><span>-1</span></sup><span>b</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> + 2</span><sup><span>0</span></sup><span>b</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> + 2</span><sup><span>1</span></sup><span>b</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> + 2</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span>b</span><sub><span>3</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>0.5b</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> + b</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> + 2b</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> + 4b</span><sub><span>3</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Counter starts from 0000 and increases each clock pulse.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Values become:</span></p><p><span>0000 → 0, 0001 → 0.5, ..., 1101 → 6.5</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Comparator works till:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>V</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span> &gt; V</span><sub><span>DAC</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>V</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span> = 6.2 V</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>At count 1101,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>V</span><sub><span>DAC</span></sub><span> = 6.5V</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Now V</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span> &lt; V</span><sub><span>DAC</span></sub><span>, so counter stops.</span></p><p><span>1101</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> = 13</span></p>",
