        "correctAnswers": [
          0
        ],
        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Duration for the individual signal is given as</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>GREEN = 70 seconds</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>YELLOW = 5 seconds</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>RED = 75 second</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Clock period = 5 seconds</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>The total number of unique states required </span>[Tex]= \\frac{70 + 5 + 75}{5} = 30.[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Minimum number of flip-flops required,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">[Tex]n = \\log_2(30) = 4.91[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]n \\cong 5.[/Tex]</p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
