        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The circuit diagram of a standard TTL NOT gate is shown in the figure. When V</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span> =2.5V, the modes of operation of the transistors will be</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-24-113327\" height=\"280\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250924113410506929/Screenshot-2025-09-24-113327.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250924113410506929/Screenshot-2025-09-24-113327.png 357w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250924113410506929/Screenshot-2025-09-24-113327-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250924113410506929/Screenshot-2025-09-24-113327-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250924113410506929/Screenshot-2025-09-24-113327-300.png 300w\" width=\"357\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2007 || EC || MCQ || 2 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
