        "explanation": "<figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925121900015543/Screenshot_2025-09-25_121645-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_2025-09-25_121645-removebg-preview\" width=\"412\" height=\"370\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925121900015543/Screenshot_2025-09-25_121645-removebg-preview.png 412w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925121900015543/Screenshot_2025-09-25_121645-removebg-preview-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925121900015543/Screenshot_2025-09-25_121645-removebg-preview-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925121900015543/Screenshot_2025-09-25_121645-removebg-preview-300.png 300w\" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925122012108220/Screenshot_2025-09-25_122018-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_2025-09-25_122018-removebg-preview\" width=\"433\" height=\"186\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925122012108220/Screenshot_2025-09-25_122018-removebg-preview.png 433w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925122012108220/Screenshot_2025-09-25_122018-removebg-preview-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925122012108220/Screenshot_2025-09-25_122018-removebg-preview-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925122012108220/Screenshot_2025-09-25_122018-removebg-preview-300.png 300w\" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span>Critical path delay&nbsp;&nbsp;= 1 + 1 = 2 ns</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span>Hence, the correct answer is 2 .</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
