        "id": 172453,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A full-scale sinusoidal signal is applied to a 10-bit ADC. The fundamental component of the ADC output has a normalized power of 1 W, and the total noise and distortion power is 10 µW. The effective number of bits (rounded off to the nearest integer) of the ADC is</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(</span><b><strong>GATE 2024</strong></b><span> ||  EC || MCQ || 2 MARK)</span></p>",
