        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The ADC output has:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Signal power = 1 W</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Noise + distortion power = </span>[Tex]10\\ \\mu\\text{W} = 10^{-5}\\ \\text{W}[/Tex]</li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>SNR = 1 / 10</span><sup><span>-5</span></sup><span> = 10</span><sup><span>5</span></sup></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>SNR</span><sub><span>dB</span></sub><span> = 10 log(10</span><sup><span>5</span></sup><span>) = 50 dB</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using ENOB formula:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>ENOB = (SNR</span><sub><span>dB</span></sub><span> − 1.76) / 6.02</span></p><p>[Tex]ENOB = (50 − 1.76) / 6.02 ≈ 8[/Tex]</p>",
