        "id": 172459,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The synchronous sequential circuit shown below works at a clock frequency of 1 GHz. The throughput, in Mbits/s, and the latency, in ns, respectively, are</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot_2025-09-25_145134-removebg-preview\" height=\"184\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925145153346585/Screenshot_2025-09-25_145134-removebg-preview.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925145153346585/Screenshot_2025-09-25_145134-removebg-preview.png 487w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925145153346585/Screenshot_2025-09-25_145134-removebg-preview-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925145153346585/Screenshot_2025-09-25_145134-removebg-preview-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925145153346585/Screenshot_2025-09-25_145134-removebg-preview-300.png 300w\" width=\"487\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(</span><b><strong>GATE 2023 </strong></b><span>||  EC || MCQ || 1 MARK)</span><br/></p>",
