        "id": 172467,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The sequence of states of the given synchronous sequential circuit is</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot_2025-09-25_150900-removebg-preview\" height=\"266\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925151342605873/Screenshot_2025-09-25_150900-removebg-preview.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925151342605873/Screenshot_2025-09-25_150900-removebg-preview.png 482w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925151342605873/Screenshot_2025-09-25_150900-removebg-preview-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925151342605873/Screenshot_2025-09-25_150900-removebg-preview-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250925151342605873/Screenshot_2025-09-25_150900-removebg-preview-300.png 300w\" width=\"482\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(</span><b><strong>GATE 2024</strong></b><span> ||  EC || MCQ || 2 MARK)</span></p>",
