        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given that,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>n</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span> = 1.5 × 10</span><sup><span>16</span></sup><span>, n</span><sub><span>n</span></sub><span> = 5 × 10</span><sup><span>20</span></sup><span> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>According to mass action law,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>n</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span>² = n</span><sub><span>n</span></sub><span> p</span><sub><span>n</span></sub><span>  ⇒  pₙ = n</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span>² / n</span><sub><span>n</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>p = (1.5 × 10</span><sup><span>16</span></sup><span>)</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> /  (5 × 10</span><sup><span>20</span></sup><span>)</span></p><p><span>= (2.25 × 10</span><sup><span>32</span></sup><span>) /  (5 × 10</span><sup><span>20</span></sup><span>)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= 4.5 × 10</span><sup><span>11</span></sup><span> /m</span><sup><span>3</span></sup></p>",
