        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>We that  R = ρl / A,  ρ = 1 / σ  and  σ = nqμ</span><sub><span>n</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>From above relation, we have</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>R = 1 / (qμ</span><sub><span>n</span></sub><span>n A)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= (0.1 × 10</span><sup><span>-2</span></sup><span>) / (5 × 10</span><sup><span>20</span></sup><span> × 1.6 × 10</span><sup><span>-19</span></sup><span> × 0.13 × 100 × 10</span><sup><span>-12</span></sup><span>) = 10</span><sup><span>6</span></sup><span> Ω</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
