        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The concentration of minority carriers in an extrinsic semiconductor under equilibrium is</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2006 || EC || MCQ ||1 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
