        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>According to mass action law, n</span><sub><span>p</span></sub><span> = n</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><sup><span>2</span></sup></p><p><span>where n</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span> = intrinsic concentration</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>N</span><sub><span>D</span></sub><span> = doping concentration for an n-type material</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>n ≅ N</span><sub><span>D</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>⇒ p</span><sub><span>n</span></sub><span> = ni² / N</span><sub><span>D</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>⇒ p</span><sub><span>n</span></sub><span> ∝ 1 / N</span><sub><span>D</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>where p = minority carrier concentration</span></p>",
