        "id": 169924,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The phenomenon known as “Early Effect” in a bipolar transistor refers to a reduction of the effective base-width caused by</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2006 || EC || MCQ||1 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
