        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>The DC current gain (β) of a BJT is 50. Assuming that the emitter injection efficiency is 0.995, the base transport factor is</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2007 || EC || MCQ || 1 MARK)</strong></b><br/></p>",
