        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Capacitance is given by, </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>C = εA / tₒₓ</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>tₒₓ = εA / C = (3.5 × 10⁻¹³ × 1 × 10⁻⁴) / (7 × 10⁻¹²)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= 5 × 10⁻⁸ m</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>tₒₓ = 50 nm</span></p>",
