        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Assuming that transistors M1 and M2 are identical and have a threshold voltage of 1V, the state of transistors M1 and M2 are respectively.</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-15-174653\" height=\"212\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250915174608056135/Screenshot-2025-09-15-174653.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250915174608056135/Screenshot-2025-09-15-174653.png 241w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250915174608056135/Screenshot-2025-09-15-174653-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250915174608056135/Screenshot-2025-09-15-174653-200.png 200w\" width=\"241\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/><b><strong>(GATE 2017 ||  EC || MCQ ||1 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
