        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In saturation region g</span><sub><span>d</span></sub><span> is given by,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\tg</span><sub><span>d</span></sub><span> = λI</span><sub><span>DS</span></sub><span> = λ </span><img height=\"39\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"135\"/><span> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t= 0.09 </span><img height=\"39\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"162\"/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\tg</span><sub><span>d</span></sub><span> = 28.35 μS </span></p>",
