        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Fill factor,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>FF = P</span><sub><span>o</span></sub><span> / (V</span><sub><span>oc</span></sub><span> I</span><sub><span>SC</span></sub><span>)  ...(1)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Efficiency,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>η = P</span><sub><span>o</span></sub><span> / P</span><sub><span>in</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>where P</span><sub><span>in</span></sub><span> = 100 mW/cm</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> × Area</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= 100 mW/cm</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> × 1 cm</span><sup><span>2</span></sup></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= 100 mW</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>0.15 = P</span><sub><span>o</span></sub><span> / 100 mW</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>P</span><sub><span>o</span></sub><span> = 15 mW  ...(2)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>From (1):</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>0.8 = 15 mW / (0.7 × I</span><sub><span>SC</span></sub><span>)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>I</span><sub><span>SC</span></sub><span> = 0.027 A</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Optical generation rate,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>G</span><sub><span>avg</span></sub><span> = I</span><sub><span>SC</span></sub><span> / (q × Area × thickness)</span></p><p><span>= 0.027 / (1.6 × 10</span><sup><span>−19</span></sup><span> × 1 × 200 × 10</span><sup><span>−4</span></sup><span>)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= 0.837 × 10</span><sup><span>19</span></sup><span> /cm</span><sup><span>3</span></sup><span>·s</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
