        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250916124740968461/Screenshot-2025-09-16-124827.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-16-124827\" width=\"302\" height=\"186\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250916124740968461/Screenshot-2025-09-16-124827.png 302w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250916124740968461/Screenshot-2025-09-16-124827-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250916124740968461/Screenshot-2025-09-16-124827-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250916124740968461/Screenshot-2025-09-16-124827-300.png 300w\" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>At 1.0 sum intensity</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tShort circuit → I</span><sub><span>SC</span></sub><span> = I</span><sub><span>S1</span></sub><span> = 20 mA</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tOpen circuit case</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\tI</span><sub><span>d</span></sub><span> = I</span><sub><span>S1</span></sub></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"96\" height=\"37\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"67\" height=\"37\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"98\" height=\"44\" loading=\"auto\"><span>\t\t…(1)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tIs ∝ sun intensity</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t∴ I</span><sub><span>s2</span></sub><span> = (I</span><sub><span>s1</span></sub><span>)(0.2)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"43\" height=\"40\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tSimilar to equation (1)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"112\" height=\"44\" loading=\"auto\"><span>(2)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tFrom (1) &amp;(2)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"201\" height=\"47\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"136\" height=\"44\" loading=\"auto\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"101\" height=\"39\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t= 0.6081 V</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"75\" height=\"23\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p><br></p>",
