        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\t(0.45 to 0.55)</span><br><span>V</span><sub><span>oc</span></sub><span> = V</span><sub><span>T</span></sub><span>. ln (J</span><sub><span>L</span></sub><span>/J</span><sub><span>5</span></sub><span>); J is directly proportional to light intensity</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\tV</span><sub><span>oc2</span></sub><span> –V</span><sub><span>oc1</span></sub><span> = V</span><sub><span>T</span></sub><span>. ln </span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"37\" height=\"44\" loading=\"auto\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t= 25 ln (20) = 0.075V.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tV</span><sub><span>oc2</span></sub><span> = 0.451V + 0.075V = 0.526V.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
