        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>The equivalent of the block diagram in the figure is given as </span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-08-19-150050\" height=\"105\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250819150130782693/Screenshot-2025-08-19-150050.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250819150130782693/Screenshot-2025-08-19-150050.png 298w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250819150130782693/Screenshot-2025-08-19-150050-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250819150130782693/Screenshot-2025-08-19-150050-200.png 200w\" width=\"298\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/><b><strong>(GATE 2004 ||  EC || MCQ||2 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
