        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>The block diagram of a feedback control system is shown in the figure.</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-01-151745\" height=\"310\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250901151732727250/Screenshot-2025-09-01-151745.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250901151732727250/Screenshot-2025-09-01-151745.png 509w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250901151732727250/Screenshot-2025-09-01-151745-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250901151732727250/Screenshot-2025-09-01-151745-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250901151732727250/Screenshot-2025-09-01-151745-300.png 300w\" width=\"509\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The transfer function Y(x)/ X(s) of the system is</span></p>",
