        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Sketching the SFG:</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2026-05-26-155846\" height=\"512\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260526160125007650/Screenshot-2026-05-26-155846.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260526160125007650/Screenshot-2026-05-26-155846.png 1427w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260526160125007650/Screenshot-2026-05-26-155846-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260526160125007650/Screenshot-2026-05-26-155846-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260526160125007650/Screenshot-2026-05-26-155846-300.png 300w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260526160125007650/Screenshot-2026-05-26-155846-660.png 660w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260526160125007650/Screenshot-2026-05-26-155846-768.png 768w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20260526160125007650/Screenshot-2026-05-26-155846-1024.png 1024w\" width=\"1427\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>By Mason’s gain formula,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Y / X = (G</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> × 1 + G</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> × 1) / [1 − (−G</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span>H)]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Y / X = (G</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> + G</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span>) / (1 + G</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span>H)</span></p>",
