        "id": 164696,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tThe unit impulse response of a system is:</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">[Tex]h(t) = e^{-t}, \\quad t \\ge 0[/Tex]<span>. \t</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For this system, the steady-state value of the output for unit step input is equal to</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>( GATE </span><b><strong>2006</strong></b><span> ||  EC || MCQ ||2  MARK)</span><br></p>",
