        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A minimum phase system does not have any poles or zeros on the right half s-plane where T(s) has one zero, s = 5 at right half s-place, so it is a non-minimum phase system</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>",
