        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given equation:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]q(s) = s^4 + s^2 + 1 = 0[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using the Routh-Hurwitz criterion,</span></p><table><thead></thead><tbody><tr><td><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]s^4[/Tex]</p></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>1</span></td></tr><tr><td><p>[Tex]s^3[/Tex]</p></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>0</span></td></tr><tr><td><p>[Tex]s^2[/Tex]</p></td><td><span>0.5</span></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>0</span></td></tr><tr><td><p>[Tex]s^1[/Tex]</p></td><td><span>-6</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>0</span></td></tr><tr><td><p>[Tex]s^0[/Tex]</p></td><td><span>1</span></td><td><span>0</span></td><td><span>0</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>All elements of the </span>[Tex]s^3[/Tex]<span> row are zero.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Auxiliary eq. </span>[Tex]s^4 + s^2 + 1 = 0[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\frac{d}{ds}(s^4 + s^2 + 1) = 0[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]4s^3 + 2s = 0[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]2s^3 + s = 0[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>No. of roots on R.H of s-plane = no of sign change = 2</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>No. of roots = order = 4</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>No. of roots on L.H. of s-plane = 4 - 2 = 2.</span></p>",
