        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>The transfer function of a lag network is</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t\tT(s) = </span><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXflRiYJCacu-Ql4DqdCAtI4Yl5gJH5XxbHUqjhLLvJveXNe6hL3dVhATUmH1ha58CkezQ6G45fsbuSVyG6Pv1IfraSE3B01eQOa2g_5SAs1T8rt8nbc8GIJSiVDHezp4NDtibfEcw?key=anOcZ8-Jg9pQ0dE-pHoJaQ\" width=\"47\" height=\"38\" loading=\"auto\"><span>\tβ &gt; 1; T &gt; 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t\t|T(jω)| = </span><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXe025Sguqx9OKWgPD4_UbxvjnzEvjRwHfYXm63iexzuLaYm0X8Fe8AxMo2d1m1iUr-WEpsD-JZKXZvS22TlnbYceg9A9ptPBoI2dJtC1vyKLlU4wgOodpQ91rzmINbgcjj_OBNo?key=anOcZ8-Jg9pQ0dE-pHoJaQ\" width=\"69\" height=\"49\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tand ∠T(jω) = tan</span><sup><span>–1</span></sup><span>(ωT) –tan</span><sup><span>–1</span></sup><span>(ωβT)&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tAt ω = 0, |T(jω)| = 1</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tAt ω = 0, ∠T(jω) = –tan</span><sup><span>–1</span></sup><span> 0 = 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tAt ω = ∞, |T(jω)|= </span><img src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfTb_pxnJWv4EGthR9AFDvmQDkc2_kXAfFZ-6xf8G0tFqsyEPnw7BGW4JUhXmrJbsoLaGX7AS9oAjhwzchpPI3GopavAtBKQOXhad_pu6lDj9NMmiw4RbOXAQe_K8eorbg6ReRHpg?key=anOcZ8-Jg9pQ0dE-pHoJaQ\" width=\"13\" height=\"38\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tAt ω = ∞, ∠T(jω)= 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>",
