        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>1. Angular Frequency Substitution</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>s = jω = j2πf</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>2. Transfer Function</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>H(f) = 5 / (1 + j10πf)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>3. Step-Response (S-Domain)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>5/s − 5/(s + 1/5)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>4. Step-Response (Time-Domain)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>5[1 − e</span><sup><span>(−t/5)</span></sup><span>]   ∀ t ≥ 0</span></p>",
