        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>In Low Pass Filter, One Pole is present at ω</span><sub><span>H</span></sub><span> (upper cutoff frequency)</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-08-26-145332\" height=\"703\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250826145346826092/Screenshot-2025-08-26-145332.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250826145346826092/Screenshot-2025-08-26-145332.png 311w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250826145346826092/Screenshot-2025-08-26-145332-100.png 44w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250826145346826092/Screenshot-2025-08-26-145332-200.png 88w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250826145346826092/Screenshot-2025-08-26-145332-300.png 133w\" width=\"311\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure>",
