        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tThe gain margin of the system under closed loop unity negative feedback is </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>[Tex]G(s)H(s) = \\frac{100}{s(s + 10)^2}[/Tex]</span><br/><b><strong>(GATE 2011 ||  EC || MCQ ||2 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
