        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>(0.49 to 0.51)\t</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tWe know that 6.02 dB/octave = 20 dB/decade</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-08-28-112333\" height=\"272\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828112253033361/Screenshot-2025-08-28-112333.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828112253033361/Screenshot-2025-08-28-112333.png 502w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828112253033361/Screenshot-2025-08-28-112333-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828112253033361/Screenshot-2025-08-28-112333-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828112253033361/Screenshot-2025-08-28-112333-300.png 300w\" width=\"502\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>The open-loop transfer function of the system is </span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span><img height=\"77\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfLALnJZBMqLtnInZKPEL4TYIdaLcNdOLB5Sa17Ye942MoAjBfALFus5OamXKkpOC9qS04KO0-kUMho4jMqvF_wIKg_sh5A72RGkRG6hsTpNAznW4eAZAPsDfKngtmjUaF3ODa-1w?key=anOcZ8-Jg9pQ0dE-pHoJaQ\" width=\"122\"/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t\t⟹ 26.02 = 20 log k – 20log(ω) for ω = 0.1</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t\t20 log k = 26.02 + 20log (0.1)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t\tk = 1.99 ≅ 2.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img height=\"77\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXdLOTAzPLOsMsabszSIR2DlVGib4cY_GW3OuELG0CPZd4tnQNv2SQ61E_Uw330VX6PmCK8Ndsq9Voffpi38cdB_8itJUDkoRiHiR_eniqu8oq0UvUmDYT1K_gytaS5Qdhmq6Nbk?key=anOcZ8-Jg9pQ0dE-pHoJaQ\" width=\"209\"/></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tSteady-state error for ramp unit </span><img height=\"39\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXcXC_lXANxj3xEqmoDQmYyzhhFdN1yEmWI_q-LNhtzrEyot62IYUPBYmVMTV5S206sEv9pYU1BDgIxMN3kdeRalEdEqvzMWhW2YD8YAlkkA7f1zN-qtsKYFuMI92ctuA5q8TASAPA?key=anOcZ8-Jg9pQ0dE-pHoJaQ\" width=\"53\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span><img height=\"43\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXfpDoiBZ9Dk3AnOzhFLB5VwUgExPqqM3RLDljsviXU3MckjwnB77Eyd8QTGjNVSrVxoNEx5jVJZIsKQxoxeo0fix_wmA6S6gqxr1eOa8MAnm0gaNer_7OnQ-iWwBMHL3yciqkPMrQ?key=anOcZ8-Jg9pQ0dE-pHoJaQ\" width=\"195\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span><img height=\"37\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXecDQ8JJh5agn-Shv8s3P-816H__4YrD85jYvgGbmf67p9MWHkS0Nza1MyYPPPXPPNyDCV_xygmiNHG9gxjG52f_l6tBMsml_cnPZlhfUM7Zb5voAs0fXeFM8D37J8yyZppn3aGAw?key=anOcZ8-Jg9pQ0dE-pHoJaQ\" width=\"71\"/></p>",
