        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The asymptotic Bode plot of a transfer function is as shown in the figure. The transfer function G(s) corresponding to this Bode plot is</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-08-28-114403\" height=\"337\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828114322167593/Screenshot-2025-08-28-114403.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828114322167593/Screenshot-2025-08-28-114403.png 495w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828114322167593/Screenshot-2025-08-28-114403-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828114322167593/Screenshot-2025-08-28-114403-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828114322167593/Screenshot-2025-08-28-114403-300.png 300w\" width=\"495\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/><b><strong>(GATE 2004 || EC || MCQ || 2 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
