        "id": 165604,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Consider the Bode magnitude plot shown in the figure. The transfer function H(s) is</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-08-28-115137\" height=\"260\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828115055804374/Screenshot-2025-08-28-115137.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828115055804374/Screenshot-2025-08-28-115137.png 528w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828115055804374/Screenshot-2025-08-28-115137-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828115055804374/Screenshot-2025-08-28-115137-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250828115055804374/Screenshot-2025-08-28-115137-300.png 300w\" width=\"528\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2004 ||  EC || MCQ ||2 MARK)</strong></b><br/></p>",
