        "id": 165658,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>A PD controller is used to compensate a system. Compared to the uncompensated system, the compensated system has&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><span>( GATE </span><b><strong>2003</strong></b><span> ||  EC || MCQ ||1  MARK</span></p>",
