        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tLag compensator:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Increases gain of the original network without stability. </span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Reduces steady-state error. </span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>Reduces speed of response.... Lead compensator: </span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>decreases gain crossover frequency.</span></li><li value=\"5\"><span>Reduces bandwidth. </span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tReduces undamped frequency.</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
