        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-08-30-112805\" height=\"177\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830112807053610/Screenshot-2025-08-30-112805.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830112807053610/Screenshot-2025-08-30-112805.png 320w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830112807053610/Screenshot-2025-08-30-112805-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830112807053610/Screenshot-2025-08-30-112805-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830112807053610/Screenshot-2025-08-30-112805-300.png 300w\" width=\"320\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span>[Tex]T(s) = \\frac{Y(s)}{U(s)} = \\frac{\\sum P_k \\Delta_k}{\\Delta}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Forward Path Gains (</span>[Tex]P_k[/Tex]<span>):  </span></p><p>[Tex]P_1 = 2 \\times \\frac{1}{s} \\times \\frac{1}{s} \\times 0.5 = \\frac{1}{s^2}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]P_2 = 2 \\times \\frac{1}{s} \\times 1 \\times 0.5 = \\frac{1}{s}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Loop Gains (</span>[Tex]\\alpha[/Tex]<span>):</span></p><p>[Tex]\\alpha_1 = \\frac{-1}{s}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\alpha_2 = \\frac{1}{s} \\times \\frac{1}{s} \\times (-1) = \\frac{-1}{s^2}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>System Determinant (</span>[Tex]\\Delta[/Tex]<span>):</span></p><p>[Tex]\\Delta = 1 - \\left[ -\\frac{1}{s} - \\frac{1}{s^2} \\right] = 1 + \\frac{1}{s} + \\frac{1}{s^2}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\Delta_1 = 1, \\Delta_2 = 1[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Substituting the values back into the formula:</span></p><p>[Tex]T(s) = \\frac{P_1\\Delta_1 + P_2\\Delta_2}{\\Delta} = \\frac{\\frac{1}{s^2} \\times 1 + \\frac{1}{s} \\times 1}{1 + \\frac{1}{s} + \\frac{1}{s^2}}[/Tex]</p><p><span> </span>[Tex]= \\frac{(1 + s)}{s^2 + s + 1}[/Tex]</p>",
