        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">[Tex]A = \\begin{bmatrix} -1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 1 &amp; -1 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">[Tex][sI - A] = \\begin{bmatrix} s &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; s \\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix} -1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 1 &amp; -1 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} s + 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ -1 &amp; s + 1 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]<span> </span></p><p>[Tex][sI - A]^{-1} = \\frac{1}{(s + 1)(s + 1)} \\begin{bmatrix} s + 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 1 &amp; s + 1 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]= \\begin{bmatrix} \\frac{1}{s + 1} &amp; 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{(s + 1)^2} &amp; \\frac{1}{s + 1} \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tState transition matrix,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span>[Tex]\\phi(t) = e^{At} = \\mathcal{L}^{-1} \\{ [sI - A]^{-1} \\}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]= \\begin{bmatrix} e^{-t} &amp; 0 \\\\ te^{-t} &amp; e^{-t} \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p>",
