        "questionType": "MSQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t(B)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span>[Tex]A = \\begin{bmatrix} -1 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; -1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; 0 &amp; -2 \\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix},[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]C = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 &amp; 1 &amp; 1 \\end{bmatrix} \\implies C^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span>[Tex]AB = \\begin{bmatrix} -1 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; -1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; 0 &amp; -2 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 + 4 + 0 \\\\ 0 - 4 + 0 \\\\ 0 + 0 + 0 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 4 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t\tA</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span>B = A.AB</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span>[Tex]= \\begin{bmatrix} -1 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; -1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; 0 &amp; -2 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} 4 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} -4 - 4 + 0 \\\\ 0 + 4 + 0 \\\\ 0 + 0 + 0 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} -8 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span>[Tex]A^T C^T = \\begin{bmatrix} -1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2 \\end{bmatrix}; A^{2T} C^T = A^T A^T C^T = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tFor controllability, |Q</span><sub><span>C</span></sub><span>| ≠ 0</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span> </span>[Tex]Q_o = \\begin{bmatrix} C^T &amp; A^T C^T &amp; A^{2T} C^T \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 &amp; -1 &amp; 1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 0 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; -2 &amp; 4 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t|Q</span><sub><span>C</span></sub><span>| = 4 × 0 = 0 ⇒ Uncontrollable,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>for observability, |Q</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span>| ≠ 0</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">[Tex]Q_o = \\begin{bmatrix} C^T &amp; A^T C^T &amp; A^{2T} C^T \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 &amp; -1 &amp; 1 \\\\ 1 &amp; 0 &amp; -1 \\\\ 1 &amp; -2 &amp; -4 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t|Q</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span>| = 1 ≠ 0 ⇒ observable.</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MSQ"
