        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Consider the state space system expressed by the signal flow diagram shown in the figure.</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-08-30-115409\" height=\"160\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830115326739234/Screenshot-2025-08-30-115409.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830115326739234/Screenshot-2025-08-30-115409.png 313w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830115326739234/Screenshot-2025-08-30-115409-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830115326739234/Screenshot-2025-08-30-115409-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250830115326739234/Screenshot-2025-08-30-115409-300.png 300w\" width=\"313\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>The corresponding system is</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2014 ||  EC || MCQ||2 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
