        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>From the signal flow graph,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\dot{x}_1 = x_2[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\dot{x}_2 = x_3[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\dot{x}_3 = a_1x_1 + a_2x_2 + a_3x_3 + u[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Output: </span>[Tex]y = c_1x_1 + c_2x_2 + c_3x_3[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\begin{bmatrix} \\dot{x}_1 \\\\ \\dot{x}_2 \\\\ \\dot{x}_3 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 \\\\ a_1 &amp; a_2 &amp; a_3 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} x_1 \\\\ x_2 \\\\ x_3 \\end{bmatrix} + \\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix} u[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Controllability Matrix (</span>[Tex]Q_c[/Tex]<span>): </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]Q_c = [B \\quad AB \\quad A^2B] = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; 1 &amp; a_3 \\\\ 1 &amp; a_3 &amp; a_2 + a_3^2 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Since </span>[Tex]|Q_c| [/Tex]<span>≠ 0, the system is controllable. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]Q_0 = \\begin{bmatrix} C^T &amp; A^T C^T &amp; A^{2T} C^T \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>∵ |Q</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span>| depends on unknown parameters.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence, the system is not always observable.</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
