        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>(A)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>From the signal flow graph, the state and output equations are defined as follows:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\dot{x}_1 = x_2[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\dot{x}_2 = x_3[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\dot{x}_3 = a_3x_3 + a_2x_2 + a_1x_1 + u[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]y = c_1x_1 + c_2x_2 + c_3x_3[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The equations are represented in the state-space form: </span>[Tex]\\dot{\\mathbf{x}} = \\mathbf{Ax} + \\mathbf{Bu} \\space  and \\space y = \\mathbf{Cx}[/Tex]<span>.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]\\begin{bmatrix} \\dot{x}_1 \\\\ \\dot{x}_2 \\\\ \\dot{x}_3 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 &amp; 1 &amp; 0 \\\\ 0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 \\\\ a_1 &amp; a_2 &amp; a_3 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} x_1 \\\\ x_2 \\\\ x_3 \\end{bmatrix} + \\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1 \\end{bmatrix} u[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]y = \\begin{bmatrix} c_1 &amp; c_2 &amp; c_3 \\end{bmatrix} \\begin{bmatrix} x_1 \\\\ x_2 \\\\ x_3 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For controllability, the determinant of the controllability matrix </span>[Tex]|Q_C|[/Tex]<span> must not be zero (</span>[Tex]|Q_C| \\neq 0[/Tex]<span>).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]Q_C = \\begin{bmatrix} B &amp; AB &amp; A^2B \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]Q_C = \\begin{bmatrix} 0 &amp; 0 &amp; 1 \\\\ 0 &amp; 1 &amp; a_3 \\\\ 1 &amp; a_3 &amp; a_2 + a_3^2 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For observability, the determinant of the observability matrix </span>[Tex]|Q_O|[/Tex]<span> must not be zero (</span>[Tex]|Q_O| \\neq 0[/Tex]<span>).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]Q_O = \\begin{bmatrix} C^T &amp; A^TC^T &amp; (A^T)^2C^T \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]Q_O = \\begin{bmatrix} c_1 &amp; c_2 &amp; c_3 \\\\ c_3a_1 &amp; c_1 + c_3a_2 &amp; c_2 + c_3a_3 \\\\ c_1(c_2 + c_3a_3) &amp; c_3a_1 + (c_2 + c_3a_3)a_2 &amp; c_1 + c_2a_2 + (c_2 + c_3a_3)a_3 \\end{bmatrix}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Since </span>[Tex]|Q_O|[/Tex]<span> depends on unknown parameters, the system is not always observable.</span></p>",
