        "id": 166110,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>A network is described by the state model as</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tX</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = 2x</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> – x</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> + 3u,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tX</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> = – 4x</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> – u,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tY = 3x</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> – 2x</span><sub><span>2</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>The transfer function H(s) = [Tex]\\left( \\frac{Y(s)}{U(s)} \\right)[/Tex]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>is:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2015 ||  EC || MCQ||2 MARK)</strong></b><br/></p>",
