        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A closed loop system is shown in the figure where k&gt;0 and α&gt;0 .The steady state error due to a ramp input (R(s)=α/s</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span>)is given by</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-03-111516\" height=\"122\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250903111436680739/Screenshot-2025-09-03-111516.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250903111436680739/Screenshot-2025-09-03-111516.png 438w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250903111436680739/Screenshot-2025-09-03-111516-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250903111436680739/Screenshot-2025-09-03-111516-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250903111436680739/Screenshot-2025-09-03-111516-300.png 300w\" width=\"438\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/><span>( GATE </span><b><strong>2023</strong></b><span> ||  EC || MCQ ||2  MARK)</span></p>",
