        "id": 164198,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Two silicon diodes, with a forward voltage drop of 0.7 V, are used in the circuit shown in the figure. The range of input voltage V</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span> for which the output voltage V</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span> = V</span><sub><span>i</span></sub><span> is,</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-08-20-160610\" height=\"166\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250820160624626731/Screenshot-2025-08-20-160610.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250820160624626731/Screenshot-2025-08-20-160610.png 422w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250820160624626731/Screenshot-2025-08-20-160610-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250820160624626731/Screenshot-2025-08-20-160610-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250820160624626731/Screenshot-2025-08-20-160610-300.png 300w\" width=\"422\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/><b><strong>(GATE 2014 || EC || PYQ || MCQ || 1 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
