        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For the BJT Q1 in the circuit shown below, β = ∞, V</span><sub><span>BE(on)</span></sub><span> = 0.7 V</span><sub><span>CE(sat)</span></sub><span> = 0.7 V. The switch is initially closed. At time t = 0, the switch is opened. The time t at which Q</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> leaves the active region is</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-08-23-112746\" height=\"234\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250823112754723182/Screenshot-2025-08-23-112746.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250823112754723182/Screenshot-2025-08-23-112746.png 377w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250823112754723182/Screenshot-2025-08-23-112746-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250823112754723182/Screenshot-2025-08-23-112746-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250823112754723182/Screenshot-2025-08-23-112746-300.png 300w\" width=\"377\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/><b><strong>(GATE 2011|| EC || PYQ || MCQ || 2  MARKS)</strong></b></p>",
