        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>After switch opens, capacitor charges with:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>I=0.5 mA</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Capacitor:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>C=5μF</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Q</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> leaves active region when collector voltage changes by 5 V.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>I = C(ΔV / t)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>t = CΔV / I</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= (5 μF × 5 V) / 0.5 mA</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= 50 ms</span></p>",
