        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Since gate and drain are connected:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>V</span><sub><span>GS</span></sub><span> = V</span><sub><span>DS</span></sub><span> = V</span><sub><span>B</span></sub><span> = 2 V</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>V</span><sub><span>T</span></sub><span> = 1 V</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So overdrive voltage:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>V</span><sub><span>OV</span></sub><span> = V</span><sub><span>GS</span></sub><span> − V</span><sub><span>T</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= 1 V</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Transconductance:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>g</span><sub><span>m</span></sub><span> = K</span><sub><span>n</span></sub><span>V</span><sub><span>OV</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= 40 μA/V</span><sup><span>2</span></sup><span> × 1 = 40 μS</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Small-signal resistance of diode-connected MOS:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>r = 1 / g</span><sub><span>m</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>= 1 / 40 μS = 25 kΩ</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
