        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>M</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> is the amplifying transistor, so gain is:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A</span><sub><span>v</span></sub><span> = −g</span><sub><span>m1</span></sub><span>R</span><sub><span>out</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Here:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>M</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> is diode-connected</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>small-signal resistance:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(1 / g</span><sub><span>m2</span></sub><span>) ∥ r</span><sub><span>o2</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>This is in parallel with r</span><sub><span>o3</span></sub><span> and r</span><sub><span>o1</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>R</span><sub><span>out</span></sub><span> = r</span><sub><span>o1</span></sub><span> ∥ [(1 / g</span><sub><span>m2</span></sub><span>) ∥ r</span><sub><span>o2</span></sub><span>] ∥ r</span><sub><span>o3</span></sub></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Therefore,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>V</span><sub><span>o</span></sub><span> / V</span><sub><span>in</span></sub><span> = −g</span><sub><span>m1</span></sub><span> [r</span><sub><span>o1</span></sub><span> ∥ ((1 / g</span><sub><span>m2</span></sub><span>) ∥ r</span><sub><span>o2</span></sub><span>) ∥ r</span><sub><span>o3</span></sub><span>]</span></p>",
