        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>At node V</span><sub><span>2 </span></sub><span>, the branch to ground is:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>R = 10kΩ</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>C = 100μF</span></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Its impedance is:</span></p><p>[Tex]Z=R+\\frac{1}{sC}\r\n=10000+\\frac{1}{100\\times10^{-6}s}\r\n=10000+\\frac{10000}{s}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]Z=10000\\frac{s+1}{s}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The series capacitor between V</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> and V</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> has:</span></p><p>[Tex]Z_C=\\frac{1}{sC}\r\n=\\frac{10000}{s}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using voltage division:</span></p><p>[Tex]\\frac{V_2}{V_1}\r\n=\\frac{Z}{Z+Z_C}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\frac{V_2}{V_1}\r\n=\r\n\\frac{\\dfrac{s+1}{s}}\r\n{\\dfrac{s+1}{s}+\\dfrac{1}{s}}\r\n=\r\n\\frac{s+1}{s+2}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\frac{V_2(s)}{V_1(s)}\r\n=\r\n\\frac{s+1}{s+2}[/Tex]</p>",
