        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Given: For I</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = 0, V</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = 4.5 V, V</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> = 1.5 V, I</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> = 1A.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tFor I</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> = 0, V</span><sub><span>1</span></sub><span> = 6 V, V</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> = 6 V, I</span><sub><span>2</span></sub><span> = 4A.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"135\" height=\"48\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"145\" height=\"48\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"135\" height=\"48\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"145\" height=\"48\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"164\" height=\"44\" loading=\"auto\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p>",
