        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For </span>[Tex]\\Delta \\rightarrow Y[/Tex]<span> conversion:</span></p><p>[Tex]R_A=\\frac{R_bR_c}{R_a+R_b+R_c}[/Tex]</p><p><span>If every delta resistor is multiplied by k:</span></p><p>[Tex]R_A'=\\frac{(kR_b)(kR_c)}{k(R_a+R_b+R_c)}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]R_A'=k\\frac{R_bR_c}{R_a+R_b+R_c}=kR_A[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Similarly, R</span><sub><span>B</span></sub><span> and R</span><sub><span>C</span></sub><span> also become k times their original values.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Scaling factor = k</span></p>",
