        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The current I in the circuit shown is</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-08-121355\" height=\"174\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908121308507175/Screenshot-2025-09-08-121355.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908121308507175/Screenshot-2025-09-08-121355.png 533w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908121308507175/Screenshot-2025-09-08-121355-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908121308507175/Screenshot-2025-09-08-121355-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908121308507175/Screenshot-2025-09-08-121355-300.png 300w\" width=\"533\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/><b><strong>(GATE EC|| 2010 MCQ || 1 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
