        "id": 168244,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>The current in the RL-circuit shown below is i(t) = 10 cos (5t – /4)A</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\tThe value of the inductor (rounded off to two decimal places) is ……. H.</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908163714854968/Screenshot-2025-09-08-163758.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-08-163758\" width=\"464\" height=\"171\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908163714854968/Screenshot-2025-09-08-163758.png 464w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908163714854968/Screenshot-2025-09-08-163758-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908163714854968/Screenshot-2025-09-08-163758-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908163714854968/Screenshot-2025-09-08-163758-300.png 300w\" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br><span>(NAT || 2020 || MCQ || 1 mark)</span><br></p>",
        "options": [
          "<p><span>2.828</span><br></p>"
        ],
        "correctAnswer": 0,
        "correctAnswers": [
          0
        ],
        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Given</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\t\t\tV</span><sub><span>s</span></sub><span> = 200 cos5t V</span></p><p><span>\t\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"119\" height=\"36\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\tBy KVL</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\t\t\tV</span><sub><span>s</span></sub><span>(t) = i(t) Z</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\tAnd z = R + jωL = R + jX</span><sub><span>L</span></sub></p><p><span>\t\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"156\" height=\"40\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\t\t\t∴ |Z| = 20</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\tOr simply </span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"60\" height=\"28\" loading=\"auto\"><span> = 20 \t…(i)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\tGiven,</span></p><p><span>\t\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"161\" height=\"43\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p><span>\t\t\t= 45°</span></p><p><span>\t\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"117\" height=\"36\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\t\t\t∴ &nbsp; X</span><sub><span>L</span></sub><span> = R \t\t…(ii)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\tFrom equation (i) and (ii)</span></p><p><span>\t\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"85\" height=\"28\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p><span>\t\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"85\" height=\"28\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p><span>\t\t\t</span><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"61\" height=\"23\" loading=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\t\t\tX</span><sub><span>L</span></sub><span> = 14.14 Ω</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\tOr\tωL = 14.14</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>\tGiven ω = 5 rad/s</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>\t\t\t∴ L = 2.828 H</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
