        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Thevenin voltage:</span></p><p>[Tex]V_{th}=10\\times\\frac{20k}{20k+20k}=5V[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Thevenin resistance:</span></p><p>[Tex]R_{th}=20k\\Omega \\parallel 20k\\Omega=10k\\Omega[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Time constant:</span></p><p>[Tex]\\tau=R_{th}C=10k\\times4\\mu F=0.04s[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\frac{1}{\\tau}=25[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Capacitor current:</span></p><p>[Tex]i_c(0^+)=\\frac{V_{th}-V_c(0)}{R_{th}}\r\n=\\frac{5}{10k}\r\n=0.5\\,mA[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Therefore,</span></p><p>[Tex]i_c(t)=0.50\\,e^{-25t}\\,mA[/Tex]</p>",
