        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><i><em class=\"GFGEditorTheme__textItalic\">(–0.28 to –0.22)</em></i></p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250918104633176332/Screenshot-2025-09-18-104607.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-18-104607\" width=\"488\" height=\"741\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250918104633176332/Screenshot-2025-09-18-104607.png 488w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250918104633176332/Screenshot-2025-09-18-104607-100.png 66w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250918104633176332/Screenshot-2025-09-18-104607-200.png 132w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250918104633176332/Screenshot-2025-09-18-104607-300.png 198w\" loading=\"auto\"><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>",
