        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><i><em class=\"GFGEditorTheme__textItalic\">(A) </em></i>[Tex]\\bar{\\nabla} \\cdot \\bar{\\text{D}} = \\rho[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\bar{\\nabla} \\times \\bar{\\text{E}} = \\frac{-\\partial \\bar{\\text{B}}}{\\partial \\text{t}}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\bar{\\nabla} \\cdot \\bar{\\text{B}} = 0[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\bar{\\nabla} \\times \\bar{\\text{H}} = \\bar{\\text{J}} + \\frac{\\partial \\bar{\\text{D}}}{\\partial \\text{t}}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\therefore 1 - \\text{Q}, 2 - \\text{R}, 3 - \\text{P}, 4 - \\text{S}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Option (A) is correct.</span></p>",
