        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(B) Depth of penetration, δ = 1 / √(πfμσ)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>or, δ ∝ 1/√f  ⇒  δ₁/δ₂ = √(f₂/f₁) = √(4/1)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>δ₂ = δ₁/2</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>δ₂ = 12.50 cm</span></p>",
