        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A rectangular wavelength of internal dimensions (a = 4 cm and b = 3 cm) is to be operated in TE 11 mode. The minimum operating frequency is</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2008 || EC || MCQ || 2 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
