        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For TE₁₁ mode:</span></p><p>[Tex]f_c\n=\n\\frac{c}{2}\n\\sqrt{\n\\left(\\frac{1}{a}\\right)^2\n+\n\\left(\\frac{1}{b}\\right)^2\n}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given:</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>a = 4 cm = 0.04 m</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>b = 3 cm = 0.03 m</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>c = 3×10</span><sup><span>8</span></sup><span> m/s</span></li></ul><p>[Tex]f_c\n=\n\\frac{3 \\times 10^8}{2}\n\\sqrt{\n\\left(\\frac{1}{0.04}\\right)^2\n+\n\\left(\\frac{1}{0.03}\\right)^2\n}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>fc​ = 6.25 GHz</span></p>",
