        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(C) Given: λ = 492 m, h = 124 m ≈ λ/4</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A tower antenna is like a quarter-wave monopole.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So, R</span><sub><span>rad</span></sub><span> = 36.5 Ω</span></p>",
