        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Let 1.001 = x</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x¹²⁵⁰ = 3.52, and x⁴⁸⁸ = 7.85</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>∴ x¹⁷³⁸ = x¹²⁵⁰ × x⁴⁸⁸ = 3.52 × 7.85</span></p><p><span>= 27.64</span></p>",
