        "correctAnswer": 3,
        "correctAnswers": [
          3
        ],
        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Category          Amount</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Food                  4000</span><br/><span>Clothing            1200</span><br/><span>Rent                  2000</span><br/><span>Savings            1500</span><br/><span>Others              1800</span><br/><span>Total               10500</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So total expenses are 10,500.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Expenses excluding savings are 9,000.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence required percentage</span></p><p><span>= (9000 / 10500) × 100 = 85.714% ≈ 86%</span></p>",
