        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In a sequence of 12 consecutive odd numbers, the sum of the first 5 numbers is 425. What is the sum of the last 5 numbers in the sequence?</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>( 2014 NAT|| 1-mark )</strong></b></p>",
