        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(495 to 495)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Sum of first 5 numbers are 425</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Middle of the numbers are 425/5 = 85</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So, first 5 numbers are 81, 83, 85, 87, 89</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Last 5 numbers of this sequence is</span></p><p><span>95, 97, 99, 101, 103</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Summation of these numbers are 495.</span></p>",
