        "id": 174063,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>40% of deaths on city roads may be attributed to drunken driving. The number of degrees needed to represent this as a slice of a pie-chart is</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>[GATE 2012 | 1 mark | MCQ]</strong></b></p>",
