        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(B)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>40% of 360° = 40/100 × 360° = 144°</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So, the number of degrees needed to represent 40% in a</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>pie chart is 144.</span></p>",
