        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(C)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Cultural diversity is the existence of a variety of cultural</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>or ethnic groups within a society.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>I. Existence of many states does not imply that the</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>country embraces cultural diversity.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>II. The population count of a country does not indicate</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>the existence of diverse cultures.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>III. Language is one of the aspects of cultural heritage.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The existence of 22 official languages and thousands</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>of dialects&amp;quot; points towards the coexistence and</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>heritage of different cultures.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>IV. Selection of players belonging to different states in a</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>national sports team does not suggest anything</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>about the India&amp;#39;s rich heritage.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Hence, option 3 is the correct answer.</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
