        "id": 174350,
        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A rule states that in order to drink beer, one must be over 18 years old. In a bar there are 4 people. P is 16years old, Q is 25 years old, R is drinking milkshake and S is drinking a beer. What must be checked to ensure that the rule is being followed?</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>[GATE 2017 | 1 marks | MCQ]</strong></b></p>",
