        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The function x(t) is shown in the figure. Even and odd parts of a unit-step function u(t) are respectively,</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-04-112032\" height=\"202\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250904112144024821/Screenshot-2025-09-04-112032.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250904112144024821/Screenshot-2025-09-04-112032.png 333w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250904112144024821/Screenshot-2025-09-04-112032-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250904112144024821/Screenshot-2025-09-04-112032-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250904112144024821/Screenshot-2025-09-04-112032-300.png 300w\" width=\"333\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2005 || EC || PYQ || MCQ || 1 MARKS)</strong></b><br/></p>",
