        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>From the graph:</span></p><p>[Tex]x(t)=\n\\begin{cases}\n-1, &amp; t&lt;0\\\\\n1, &amp; t&gt;0\n\\end{cases}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So, x(t) = 2u(t) - 1</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For a unit-step function u(t):</span></p><p>[Tex]u_e(t)=\\frac{u(t)+u(-t)}{2}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]u_o(t)=\\frac{u(t)-u(-t)}{2}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Since u(t) + u(-t) = 1,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]u_e(t)=\\frac{1}{2}[/Tex]<span> and x(t) = u(t) - u(-t)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Therefore, </span>[Tex]u_o(t)=\\frac{x(t)}{2}[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\frac{1}{2},\\ \\frac{x(t)}{2}[/Tex]</p>",
