        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The input and output of a continuous time system are respectively denoted by x(t) and y(t). Which of the following descriptions corresponds to a causal system?</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2008  || EC || PYQ || MCQ || 1 MARKS)</strong></b></p>",
