        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Use the property:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x(t) ∗ δ(t-a) = x(t-a)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x(t+5) ∗ δ(t-7)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Replace x(t) by x(t+5):</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x((t-7) + 5)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x(t-2)</span></p>",
