        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Given</strong></b></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>h[0] = 1, h[1] = -1, h[2] = 2</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x[0] = 1, x[2] = 1</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Since</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x[n] = δ[n] + δ[n-2]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Output:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>y[n] = h[n] + h[n-2]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Now,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>h[n] = [1,-1,2]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>h[n-2] = [0,0,1,-1,2]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Adding:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>y[n] = [1,-1,3,-1,2]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>So:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Number of non-zero samples = 5</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>y[2] = 3</span></p>",
