        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Use the property:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>δ(-t-t</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span>​) = δ(t+t</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span>​)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(since δ(-x) = δ(x)).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Then</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x(-t) ∗ δ(t+t</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span>​)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Using, f(t) ∗ δ(t-a) = f(t-a)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>with a = -t</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span>,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x(-(t+t</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span>​))</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>x(-t - t</span><sub><span>0</span></sub><span>)</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
