        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>For an LTI system:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Step response s(t) = h(t) ∗ u(t)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Taking derivative on both sides:</span></p><p>[Tex]\\frac{d}{dt}s(t)=h(t)*\\delta(t)[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Since</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>f(t) ∗ δ(t) = f(t)</span></p><p>[Tex]\\frac{d}{dt}s(t)=h(t)[/Tex]</p><p>[Tex]\\text{Impulse response } h(t)\n=\n\\frac{d}{dt}\\bigl(\\text{step response}\\bigr)[/Tex]</p>",
