        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The output y[n] of a discrete-time system for an input x[n] is </span>[Tex]y[n] = \\max_{-\\infty &lt; k \\leq n} |x[k]|[/Tex]<span>. The unit impulse response of the system is</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2020 || EC || PYQ || NAT || 1 MARKS)</strong></b></p>",
