        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The trigonometric Fourier series for the waveform f(t) shown below contains</span></p><figure class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-08-162334\" height=\"330\" loading=\"auto\" src=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908162357148521/Screenshot-2025-09-08-162334.png\" srcset=\"https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908162357148521/Screenshot-2025-09-08-162334.png 455w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908162357148521/Screenshot-2025-09-08-162334-100.png 100w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908162357148521/Screenshot-2025-09-08-162334-200.png 200w,https://media.geeksforgeeks.org/wp-content/uploads/20250908162357148521/Screenshot-2025-09-08-162334-300.png 300w\" width=\"455\"/><figcaption> </figcaption></figure><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(GATE 2010 || EC || PYQ || MCQ || 1 MARKS)</strong></b></p>",
