        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>R = 200kΩ, C = 10μF</span></p><p>[Tex]RC = 200 \\times 10^{3} \\times 10 \\times 10^{-6} = 2[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Sampling frequency f</span><sub><span>s</span></sub><span> = 10 Hz</span></p><p>[Tex]T_s = \\frac{1}{f_s} = 0.1\\,\\text{s}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Capacitor discharge:</span></p><p>[Tex]v(t) = 5e^{-t/RC}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Sampling at t=nT:</span></p><p>[Tex]x(n) = 5e^{-nT_s/RC} = 5e^{-n(0.1)/2} = 5e^{-0.05n}[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Therefore, </span>[Tex]x(n) = 5e^{-0.05n}[/Tex]</p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
