        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Consider the matrix A below:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A = [ 2   3   4   5</span></p><p><span>      0   6   7   8</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>      0   0   α   β</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>      0   0   0   γ ]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For which of the following combinations of α, β and γ is the rank of A at least three?</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(i) α = 0 and β = γ ≠ 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(ii) α = β = γ = 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(iii) β = γ = 0 and α ≠ 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(iv) α = β = γ ≠ 0</span></p>",
