        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Explanation:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A = [ 2   3   4   5</span></p><p><span>      0   6   7   8</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>      0   0   α   β</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>      0   0   0   γ ]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Required, ρ(A) ≥ 3</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>⇒ ρ(A) = 3 or 4</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(i) For α = 0 and β = γ ≠ 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A ≅ [ 2   3   4   5</span></p><p><span>      0   6   7   8</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>      0   0   0   β</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>      0   0   0   β ≠ 0 ]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>∴ R3 = R4</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>⇒ ρ(A) = 3 ≥ 3</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>∴ (i) is true</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(ii) For α = β = γ = 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A ≅ [ 2   3   4   5</span></p><p><span>      0   6   7   8</span></p><p><span>      0   0   0   0</span></p><p><span>      0   0   0   0 ]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>⇒ ρ(A) = 2 &lt; 3</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>∴ (ii) is false</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(iii) For β = γ = 0 and α ≠ 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A ≅ [ 2   3   4   5</span></p><p><span>      0   6   7   8</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>      0   0   α   0</span></p><p><span>      0   0   0   0 ]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>⇒ ρ(A) = 3 ≥ 3</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>∴ (iii) is true</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>(iv) For α = β = γ ≠ 0</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br/></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A ≅ [ 2   3   4   5</span></p><p><span>      0   6   7   8</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>      0   0   α   β</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>      0   0   0   α ]</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>⇒ ρ(A) = 4 ≥ 3</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>∴ (iv) is true</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Final Answer:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Correct options are (i), (iii), and (iv)</span></p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
