        "correctAnswers": [
          0
        ],
        "questionType": "MCQ",
        "natRange": null,
        "explanation": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]s(t) = A_c \\cos \\omega_c t + 2 \\cos \\omega_m t \\cos \\omega_c t[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]s(t)=\\left(A_c + 2\\cos \\omega_m t\\right)\\cos \\omega_c t[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For envelope detection, the envelope must never become negative:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]A_c + 2\\cos \\omega_m t \\geq 0[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Since cosω</span><sub><span>m</span></sub><span>t can be as low as −1,</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]A_c - 2 \\geq 0[/Tex]</p><p dir=\"ltr\">[Tex]A_c \\geq 2[/Tex]</p>",
        "tag": "GATE ECE || MCQ"
