        "question": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>In a PCM system, if the code word length is increased from 6 to 8 bits, the signal-to-quantization noise ratio improves by the factor</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>(PYQ || 2004  MCQ || 1 MARK)</strong></b></p>",
